<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Sari</book>
  <para style="h">Mak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ntoŋ wu dzeeŋ wu kii Jiso si Mak tɛ̀ tsɛɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mak</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ntoŋ wu dzeeŋ wu kii Jiso si</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt2">tɛ̀ tsɛɛ</para>
  <para style="imt1">Fiee fi nuuŋ lɛ Kiŋwaati ki Ma-ak kini</para>
  <para style="ip">Ntoŋ wu dzeeŋ wu Mak tɛ̀ tsɛɛ wuni doonchi le Jiso nuuŋ wi wu tɛ̀ fɛ biee tuu kɛmi buŋga le ɛ wu tee fiee fi nuuŋ si wu tee. Tɛ̀ doonchi buŋga bu ntiifɛ we-e bɛ kii mbusu bɛnchindaa bɛ kiŋkundi-i, mɔɔ mfekisɛ bibifi bi bɛniiŋ lɛ. Jiso tɛ̀ gii teenyi yi yee le nuuŋ wi wu bukooŋ bwee nuuŋ le Ŋwanɛwi, wu bɛ le nyɛ yi yee le soo bɛniiŋ. Bukooŋ buni nuuŋ bu nuuŋ lɛ Kiŋwaati ki Danyɛ-ɛ 7:3-14.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mak tɛ̀ tsɛɛ ŋge nuuŋ kii biee bi Jiso tɛ̀ fɛ yaa bi tɛ̀ gii tiiti. Bibe bi lɛ kimɛrisɛ lɛ kiŋwaati kini tiiti kii biee bi tɛ̀ ka bɛ Jiso li fuu wu lɛ kimɛrisɛ-ɛ, teege si bɛ tɛ̀ ta wu li kintaaŋ li, bɛ si tɛ̀ bu li kwe-e yɛɛ liboo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Bikoo bi biee bi lɛ Kiŋwaati kini-i</para>
  <para style="io1">1:1-13 Mbɛɛchɛ wu toŋ wu dzeeŋ kii Jiso</para>
  <para style="io1">1:14–9:50 Nimɛ chi Jiso-o kimbɛ ki Galilii</para>
  <para style="io1">10:1-52 Jiso dza Galilii gɛɛŋ Jɛrosalɛŋ</para>
  <para style="io1">11:1–15:47 Fuu wu Jiso wu kimɛrisɛ li Jɛrosalɛŋ lichiŋ mɔɔ Jɛrosalɛŋ</para>
  <para style="io1">16:1-8 Jiso bo li kwe-e</para>
  <para style="io1">16:9-20 Jiso tɛ̀ doonchɛ yi yee fɛ tɛ̀ bo li kwe-e bɛ si tɛ̀ yɛki liboo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Ntoŋ wu Jɔɔŋ Nlisulidzɔɔ tɛ̀ fenjisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Maacho 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jɔɔŋ 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Wuni nuuŋ ntoŋ wu dzeeŋ wu kii Jiso Krai wu Ŋwanɛ Nyɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Fi tɛ̀ bɛchi nɛɛ si Ɛsaya wu ntomfɔŋ wu Nyɔ tɛ̀ tsɛɛ le Nyɔ tiiti yɛ le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Yikɛ ɔ woo, ŋgii ntuumi wi wɛŋ wu ntoŋ ni tuuti mbaaŋ li wɛ-ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">gii gɛɛŋ nachɛ dze ya.<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Jɛ yi wi dii yɛ libuka le bɛ nachɛ dze yi Taa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">bɛ leeki yi ni yi nuuŋ tsaaŋ.”<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Bɛdɛɛni, wi wumu wu bɛ tɛ̀ teenyi le Jɔɔŋ Nlisulidzɔɔ tɛ̀ dza busɛ libuka, fenjisi li bɛniiŋ li le be fiiki shéŋ yibe, lii be li dzɔɔ Nyɔ se feeki bibifi bi bee. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Bɛniiŋ se tɛ̀ dzɛti li bitoŋ bi kwɛɛŋ wu Judiya kwikwi mɔɔ li kitoŋ ki Jɛrosalɛ-ɛŋ kichu be giiŋgi lɛ Jɔɔŋ li, be teyi bibifi bi bee, se lisi be li dzɔɔ, li Dzɔɔ yi Joodaaŋ.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Jɔɔŋ tɛ̀ lisi ndú yi bɛ nachɛ bɛ dzúŋ yi nyaŋ yimi yi bɛ teenyi le kamɛɛ, tɛ̀ kɛndi kitsaa litiŋ ɛ bɛ nachɛ bɛ dzi yi nyaŋ, jii nuuŋ tsóma bɛ ŋgɔɔ yi litɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Tɛ̀ gii fenjisi lɛ, tiiti le, “Wumu bɛɛɔ lɛ mi-i jiŋ wu ko wu yaa mi, mɛɛŋɔ mɔɔ ki kɔchɛ kɛ le ŋguumɛ mfanchɛ bikpɔ biee kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Nlisɔɔ beŋ nuuŋ li dzɔɔ, se nuuŋ le, gii lii fiee beŋ nuuŋ li tsaŋ yi Fiana yi Waaŋ li.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Si bɛ tɛ̀ lii Jiso li dzɔɔ bɛ si Sataŋ tɛ̀ mɔnchɛ wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Maacho 3:13–4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Nɛɛ li jo yɛɛ, Jiso dza Nasarɛ kimbɛ ki Galilii, bɛ Jɔɔŋ lii wu li dzɔɔ, li Dzɔɔ yi Joodaaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Nɛɛ si Jiso tɛ̀ buti li dzɔɔ ni, biee ŋɛŋ si kiboo gwiyɛ, Fiana yi Waaŋ shiiti yi bɛɛ li wuu bwiŋ si kibimɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Jɛ se yɔ liboo le, “Ɔ nuuŋ Ŋwanɛŋ wu shéŋ, ŋ'wuki bujɔŋ bɛ wɛ ŋge.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Fiana yi Waaŋ biee yi fɛ mfwaa mumkpaŋ Jiso gɛɛŋ tsiiŋ libuka. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Tɛ nuuŋ lu li jo mbaanyɛɛ li, Sataŋ mɔnchi wu. Tɛ nuuŋ lu lɛ, bɛ nyáŋ yi tɔɔ, bɛnchindaa bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ bichi lɛ wuu.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso teeŋ bɛniiŋ bɛnɛɛ le be ni <optbreak/> be nuuŋ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Maacho 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Bɛ tɛ̀ dza bɛ kɔɔ Jɔɔŋ bɛ gɛɛ li yih yi ncha-a. Le ni nuuŋ lɛjiŋ lɛlu, Jiso gɛɛŋ Galilii, fenjisi ntoŋ wu dzeeŋ wu kii Nyɔ le. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>Tɛ̀ bɛchi fenjisi, tiiti le, “Mfi kɔchɔɔ, bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ bwɛɛ tsɛkɛtsɛkɛ. Fiiki yɛɛŋ shéŋ yinɛ, nɛ beŋ li ntoŋ wu dzeeŋ wuni-i.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Jiso dza le ni kɛti li Libɛ chi Galilii lichiŋ, ŋɛŋ Simu bee ŋwaani wu Andolo be lendi gwii lɛ libɛ-ɛ, ɛ nimɛ chi bee tɛ nuuŋ nsúuŋ yi kɔfɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Jiso tee li bee le, “Biee yɛɛŋ mi mfɛ nɛ ni nɛ keeti nuuŋ bɛniiŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Mfwaa mumkpaŋ, be biee be chinɛ gii yibe fe, be biki wu. <verse eid="MRK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Jiso tuu kiiŋgi gɛɛŋ limfwe niiŋ, ŋɛŋ Jeeŋ bee ŋwaani wu Jɔɔŋ, bɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ bɔɔŋ bɛ Dzɛbɛdii, bee be nuuŋ lɛ ŋgo-o be tuushi gii yi nsúuŋ. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Jiso se tuu teeŋ tɛ be. Be shɛ tee wu be lɛ ŋgo bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ be tɛ̀ dzɔ le be ni be nindi li bee, be se biee wu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Jiso bee be se dza be gɛɛŋ li kitoŋ ki Kapanu-uŋ. Le ni nuuŋ jobɛ chi bɛshiinshi, Jiso se biee gɛɛŋ li yih yi nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ tiifi bɛniiŋ lu. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Bɛniiŋ wuki, wa tii be bɛ ntiifɛ we, kifɛ tɛ tiifi si wi wu kɛmi buŋga bu ntiifɛ-ɛ. Tɛ̀ gii tiifi yɛ si bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ ti shiiŋ be tiifi lɛ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Nɛɛ li mfi wulu-u, wumu tɛ dza fɛsi li yih yi nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ yilu-u, ɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ wi wu fiana yi tii tɛ̀ nuuŋ wu libwiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>Le lɛ lu, biee waŋ le, “Jiso wu Nasarɛ, ɛ la fi ɔ wɛki le ɔ fɛ bɛ bee? Ɔ bɛ le ɔ lɛɛshɛ bee ni? Ŋkiiɔ wi wu nuuŋ wɛ. Ɛ wɛ wi wu Waaŋ wu dza fɛ Nyɔ-ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Jiso waŋ fiana yi tii yilu, tee le, “Makɛ, bo li wi wuni-i!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Fiana yi tii yilu se fɛ wu we fɛkwiiŋ kakini, yi waŋ lɛwe ŋge, yi se bo li wuu bwiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Le bɛniiŋ ŋɛŋ lɛ, bimfimu wondɛ be, be bɛchi be tiiti li yi yi bee, be biiti laa, “Fini nuuŋ la? Ɛ ntiifɛ wumu wu fwɛŋ ni? Wi wuni kɛmɔɔ buŋga bu wanɛ mɔɔ fiana yi tii yi wuki li wuu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Mfwaa mumkpaŋ, ntoŋ wu kii Jiso saaŋgɛ gɛɛŋ bintsii bichu bi li kimbe ki Galilii.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso wɔnchɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ chigɔ-ɔŋ ŋge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Maacho 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Jiso bo li yih yi nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ yilu-u, gɛɛŋ li yih yi Simu bee Andolo-o, ɛ Jeeŋ bee Jɔɔŋ tɛ̀ nuuŋ bee be. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Tɛ̀ nuuŋ ɛ mwɛsɛ Simu tɛ̀ gimi lu, gendi bɛ kiŋkɛŋkɛ. Nɛɛ si Jiso tɛ̀ lɛ li yih yilu lɛ, be biee be tee wu kii kwɛɛŋ wulu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Jiso gɛɛŋ fɛ tɛ̀ gimi fɛɛ, kɛmɛ wu li kibɛnɛ-ɛ, tsaaki wu we. Kiŋkɛŋkɛ kɛɛ se biee ki chikɛ li wuu, dza we, bichɛ fiee fijɛ nyɛ be.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Le ni nuuŋ lɛ fɛmfo-o booyaa jobɛ sechi, be tuu be bɛɛ bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛchu bɛ tɛ̀ gendi mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bɛ bɔɔŋ bɛ kiŋkundi-i tɛ̀ ŋwɛki bɛ be lɛ Jiso-o. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Kitoŋ kilu kichu se banchɛ lɛ fweeŋ. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Wɔnchɛ bɛniiŋ ŋge bɛ tɛ̀ kɛmi chigɔŋ chichi chichi, tuu bushi tɛ bɔɔŋ bɛ kiŋkundi-i ŋge li bɛniiŋ bamu-u. Ɛ busi lɔɔ, tɛ beŋ le bɛnchindaa bɛlu ni be yeti kɛ, kifɛ be tɛ̀ kii wi wu tɛ nuuŋ wu.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso feenji jɛ yi Nyɔ Galilii kichu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Le ni mɛɛŋ fɛŋwɛɛ taantaaŋ lɛkuuŋ mɛɛŋ fiii Jiso dza we, bo gɛɛŋ fɛ kintsii kimu wuu mbiiŋ lɛki li Nyɔ-ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simu bee bɛniiŋ bɛ bee be tɛ̀ nuuŋ, shɛ be bo be gɛɛŋ le be gɔɔŋ wu. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Be gɛɛŋ be ŋɛŋ wu, be tee li wuu le, “Bɛniiŋ bɛchu bee be shɛ be wɛki wɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Jiso tuu fiee li bee le, “Tɛ lenchi tɛ gɛɛŋ li bitoŋ bimu nse mfeenji tɛ jɛ yi Nyɔ le. Ɛ fiee fi ntɛ̀ mbɛ kii fi.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Se deŋgi kimbe ki Galilii kichu fenjisi jɛ yi Nyɔ li yíh yi nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ yibee, buushi bɔɔŋ bɛ kiŋkundi-i li yí yi bɛniiŋ li.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso wɔnchɛ wi wu tɛ̀ gendi bɛ chigɔŋ chi nɔŋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Maacho 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Wumu wu tɛ̀ gendi bɛ chigɔŋ chi nɔŋa tɛ̀ dza bɛ toŋ núŋ Jiso limfwe, lɛki wu tiiti le, “Ɔ nuuŋ nɛɛ ɔ wɔnchɛ mi ni ŋ'wuuti, ɔɔ kɔŋgisi lɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Nshiiŋ kɔɔ Jiso, nɛɛki kibɛnɛ koŋ li wuu, tee li wuu le, “Ŋkɔŋgisɔɔ, tɛmi lɛ, ɔ ni ɔ wuuti.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Mfwaa mumkpaŋ, chigɔŋ chi nɔŋa chilu biee chi chinɛ li wuu, tɛmi, woo. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Jiso se tee li wuu le ni giiŋgi, bɔsɛyi chiinsɛ li wuu, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>tee le, “Ŋɛŋ le kiiŋ ɔ ni tee li wi-i kɛ. Se nuuŋ le, gɛnɛ ɔ doonchɛ yi ya li te muntofi-i, ɔ se nyɛ nya yi Mɔɔsɛ tɛ̀ tiiti le wi kɛmi le nyɛ le doonchɛ li bɛniiŋ li le wu tɛmɔɔ li chigɔŋ chini-i wuuti.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Si Jiso chiinsɛ lɛ, wi wulu se tuu gɛɛŋ yaki fiee filu. Ntoŋ wulu se saaŋgɛ, dze foo yi Jiso nuuŋ tuu ni lii li kito-oŋ gbanaa. Se ba fiee nuuŋ litɔɔ, bɛniiŋ dzɛti li bitsii li, li bitsii li, be bɛɛ lɛ wuu.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Jiso wɔnchɛ wi wu ŋgwɛ tɛ̀ kɔɔ kimbɛ kimumkpaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Maacho 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Le jo ka niiŋ, Jiso kaari to lijiŋ Kapanuŋ. Bɛniiŋ woo le wɛ fɛkuuŋ kituŋ, <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>be banchɛ be bɛ fe ŋge, dze foo yi nuuŋ wi tɔmi kikaa mɔɔ nuuŋ fweeŋ, se fenjisi jɛ yi Nyɔ li bee. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Bɛniiŋ bamu dza be bɛɛ be bɛnɛɛ bɛ wi wumu ɛ be sumɛ wu fɛ kida-aŋ, ɛ ŋgwɛ tɛ̀ kɔɔ wu kimbɛ kimumkpaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Fi yaa be fɛ nuuŋ be gɛɛŋ bɛ wu fɛ Jiso-o kifɛ bɛniiŋ tɛ̀ yiŋgɛ fe ŋge. Be se beeŋ nuuŋ lɛ yi-ih lɛwe, be tɔ kiyɛ. Le be tɔ lɛ, be shiiki wi wulu fɛ fiee fi tɛ̀ gimi fe fiɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Jiso ŋɛŋ si be gɛɛ shéŋ li wuu, se tee li wi wu ŋgwɛ tɛ̀ wu kɔɔ kimbɛ kimumkpaŋ wɛ-ɛ le, “Sinɛŋ, mi mfeekɔɔ bibifi bio.” <verse eid="MRK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Bɛniiŋ bamu bɛ tɛ̀ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ bɛ tɛ̀ shee yɛ fe be wuki se bɛchi be ŋuŋini lɛ shéŋ lɛ shéŋ, be biiti laa, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>“Wi wuni tiiti ni, kii la? Dzetɔɔ kintsii ki Nyɔ-ɔ. Ɛ noo wu nuuŋ feeki bibifi fuki Nyɔ nsiŋ?” <verse eid="MRK 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Jiso biee kɛɛ li shéŋ yee li fiee fi be tɛ̀ beechi, bii li bee laa, “Nɛ kɛmi ŋwaani bani bɛmbeechɛ li shéŋ yinɛ ni kii la? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Fi tsɛkɛ fi tefɛ li wi wuni nuuŋ fi la? Ɛ ntefu le mi mfeekɔɔ bibifi biee mɔɔ le dzɔ kidaŋ kee ni giiŋgi le? <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Se nuuŋ le, ŋgii mfɛ nɛ kɛɛ le Ŋwanɛwi kɛmi buŋga laaŋkwiiŋ bu fekisɛ bibifi.” Le tee lɛ, biee tee li wi wu ŋgwɛ tɛ̀ kɔɔ wu wɛ-ɛ le, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>“Dza we ɔ dzɔɔ kidaŋ ko ɔ ni ɔ giiŋgi li yih.” <verse eid="MRK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Se dza we, dzɔ kidaŋ kee buti bɛniiŋ bɛchu bichi wu. Le be nɛŋ lɛ, bimfimu wondɛ be, be bɛchi be yɔɔnchi Nyɔ, be tiiti le, “Tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ baa saa ki ŋɛŋ kɛ ŋwaani fini fiee kɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso teeŋ Lebi le ni nuuŋ ŋwani wu kintutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Maacho 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Jiso tuu dza gɛɛŋ li libɛ-ɛ lichiŋ, kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ bɛ fe, bɛchi tiifi be. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Le dza ni giiŋgi, ŋɛŋ Lebi wu ŋwanɛ Afiyus, ɛ wu shee fɛ kintsii kee ki nimɛ-ɛ, kundi kiŋwaati. Jiso tee li wuu le, “Ɔ biki mi!” Dza we biki wu.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu gɛɛŋ be jii biee li Lebi yih bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ kundi kiŋwaati mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bamu bɛ bifi. Ŋwaani bani bɛniiŋ tɛ̀ shiiŋ be biki wu ŋge. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Bɛfarasii bɛ tɛ̀ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ ŋɛŋ si Jiso jii biee bee bɛniiŋ bɛ bifi mɔɔ bɛ tɛ̀ kundi kiŋwaati, be se bii li bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u laa, “Ɛ kii la fi jii biee bee bɛniiŋ bɛ kundi kiŋwaati mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bɛ bifi bamu?” <verse eid="MRK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Le Jiso woo si be bii lɛ, tee li bee le, “Bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛɛmi ti wɛki yɛ wi wu ntsi kɛ. Ɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ gendi bɛ ti wɛki. Mɛɛŋɔ ki mbɛ kɛ le nteeŋ nuuŋ bɛniiŋ bɛ nuuŋ tsaaŋ kɛ. Mi mbɛ le nteeŋ nuuŋ bɛ bifi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bimfu kii njiru biee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Maacho 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Tɛ nuuŋ mfi wumu ɛ bɔɔŋ bɛ Jɔɔŋ lɛ bɛ kintutu-u, mɔɔ bɛ Bɛfarasii tɛ̀ jiti biee. Bɛniiŋ bamu tuu be bɛ be bii li Jiso laa, “Fi geeŋ fi bɔɔŋ bɛ kintutu-u bɛ Jɔɔŋ lɛ, mɔɔ bɛ Bɛfarasii jiti biee, se bɔɔŋ bo bɛ kintutu-u tɛ ji tɛ kɛ?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Jiso tuu li bee le, “Nuuŋ bɛ teeŋ bɛniiŋ fɛ bugoo li be gɛɛŋ be tuu be ni be jiti biee nyuŋ wutso mɛɛŋ bee be ni? Nuuŋ be tɛ ji biee bijɛ fɛ mɛɛŋ bee be kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Se nuuŋ le, mfi gii naa bɛ wu bɛ gii bɛ fi nyuŋ wutso wulu li bee, be se bɛchi be ni be jiti biee bijɛ li mfi wulu-u. <verse eid="MRK 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>Nuuŋ wi tɛ dzɔ shɛŋgɛ yi ndu yi fiɛŋ le tuushɛ ndu yi fichi lu kɛ. Ɛ wu fɛ lɛ, nshɛŋgɛ yi ndu yilu mɛɛshi yi gaamɛ ndu yi fichi yilu bu gaamɛ, fiooŋ yi nuuŋ fe se mɛɛshi yi ko yi yaa si yi tɛ saa yi nuuŋ. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Nuuŋ wi tɛ gɛɛ mbiiŋ mɛ fɛŋ lɛ kibɛɛŋ ki bɛ nachɛ bɛ dzi yi nyaŋ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kibɛɛŋ ki mbiiŋ lɛ Bɛjuu tɛ̀ shiiŋ be nachi nuuŋ bɛ dzi yi nyaŋ.</char></note> yi kɔɔ yi doŋ kɛ. Ɛ wu fɛ lɛ, mbiiŋ mɛ fɛŋ mɛlu wo kibɛɛŋ ki fichi kilu, mbiiŋ bɛ kibɛɛŋ kilu la li yee li. Fi chɛɛŋ fiɛɛ le, bɛ kɛmi le bɛ gɛɛ mbiiŋ mɛ fɛŋ nuuŋ lɛ kibɛɛŋ ki fɛ-ɛŋ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bimfu kii jobɛ chi bɛshiinshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Maacho 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Tɛ̀ nuuŋ jobɛ chi bɛshiinshi chimu, Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u tɛ̀ deŋgi be kɛti li wɛ wu giiŋ wumu-u. Bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u bɛchi be soomi bikoo bi giiŋ lɛ be jii. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Bɛfarasii ŋɛŋ lɛ, be bii li Jiso laa, “Bichɛ ɔ ŋɛŋ, fi geeŋ fi bɔɔŋ bo bɛ kintutu-u feti fiee fi nchi mɛɛŋ ki be-eŋ le wi fɛ jobɛ chi bɛshiinshi kɛ?” <verse eid="MRK 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Jiso bii tɛ li bee laa, “Nɛ mɛɛŋ baa saa ki teeŋ kɛ lɛ Kiŋwaati ki Nyɔ-ɔ si dzeeŋ tɛ̀ wuu Mfɔŋ Daafi bee bɛniiŋ bee fɛ ni? <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Tɛ̀ nuuŋ mfi wu Abiata tɛ̀ nuuŋ kikoo ki bɛte muntofi-i, Daafi lɛ li yih yi Nyɔ-ɔ dzɔ kibele ki bɛ tɛ̀ tsaa bɛ gɛɛ le ɛ ki Nyɔ-ɔ ki te muntofi tɛ̀ nyɛ wu, ji nyɛ mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bee, ɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ nchi le nuuŋ wi tɛ ji kibele kilu fuki bɛte muntofi nsiŋ kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Jiso se mɛɛshi tee li bee le, “Nyɔ tɛ̀ gɛɛ jobɛ chi bɛshiinshi kii wi. Tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ ki tɔŋ kɛ wi kii jobɛ chi bɛshiinshi kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Se nuuŋ le, Ŋwanɛwi nuuŋ Te Kikoo wu bwɛɛshiinshi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jiso wɔnchɛ wi wu ŋgwɛ tɛ̀ kɔɔ li kibɛnɛ-ɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Maacho 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Jiso tuu gɛɛŋ lɛ li yih yi nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ. Wi wumu tɛ̀ nuuŋ lu ɛ ŋgwɛ kɔɔ wu li kibɛnɛ-ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Bɛniiŋ bamu tɛ̀ nuuŋ lu be wɛki fiee fi nuuŋ be kayɛ li Jiso-o nsiŋ, be se toŋ lii li wuu be bichi laa gii wɔnchɛ wi wulu jobɛ chi bɛshiinshi le. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Jiso se tee li wi wu ŋgwɛ tɛ̀ kɔɔ wu wɛɛ le, “Dza we ɔ bɛ fɛni.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Le mwɛ bɛ, Jiso bii li bɛniiŋ li laa, “Fiee fi nchi beenchi le nuuŋ wi fɛ jobɛ chi bɛshiinshi nuuŋ fi la? Ɛ mfɛru fiee fi dzeeŋ, mɔɔ fi bifi le? Nsofu wi, mɔɔ ŋ'wo wi le?” Be chikɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Jiso dzɔ shéŋ bɛ be, bichɛ be bɛchu kɛnɛ, yi wɔɔ wu kii shéŋ yibe yi bifi. Tee li wi wu ŋgwɛ tɛ̀ kɔɔ wu li kibɛnɛ-ɛ wɛɛ le, “Nɛɛki kibɛnɛ ko.” Nɛɛki ki, ki se biee ki tɛmi. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Bɛfarasii se bo, be gɛɛŋ bɛ kintutu ki bɛniiŋ bɛ Mfɔŋ Hɛrɔ-ɔ, be gɛɛŋ be lii ntsuuŋ si be gii be wo Jiso.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛniiŋ dzɛti bimbe bichu be bɛɛ lɛ Jiso-o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u dza fe be gɛɛŋ fɛ libɛ chi Galilii. Kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ ki nɔŋa biee wu fe. Bɛniiŋ bamu tɛ dza kimbɛ ki Galilii bɛ ki Judiya. <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>Bamu dza tɛ̀ Jɛrosalɛŋ bamu kimbɛ ki Idumea, bamu dzɛti liwiŋ li Dzɔɔ yi Joodaaŋ, bamu bimbɛ bi Tayɛ bɛ bi Sidɔ-ɔŋ. Kintutu ki nɔŋa kilu tɛ̀ bɛ nɛɛ lɛ kifɛ be tɛ̀ wuki biee bi Jiso tɛ̀ feti bichu. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Jiso dza tee li bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u le be gɔɔŋ ŋgo be nachɛ be gɛɛ se lɛ le kii kintutu kilu ni dza ki ni ki fachi wu. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Tɛ tee lɛ kifɛ tɛ̀ saa wu wɔnchɛ bɛniiŋ ŋge, bɛniiŋ bɛ chigɔ-ɔŋ se mɛɛŋ be bɛɛ le be koŋ li wuu. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Le bɛniiŋ bɛ Fiana yi tii ti ŋwɛki bɛ be tuu be ŋɛŋ Jiso, be weyɛ wu limfwe be dii be tiiti le, “Ɛ wɛ Ŋwanɛ Nyɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Si be tɛ̀ dii lɛ, Jiso gbɛɛnɛ chiinsɛ li bee bu chiinsinɛ le kiiŋ be ni fɛ le bɛniiŋ kɛɛ wu kɛ.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso tsaa bɛniiŋ yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ <optbreak/> le be ni be nuuŋ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ nto-oŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Maacho 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Tɛ̀ dza miri gɛɛŋ li ŋkumɛ-ɛ, teeŋ bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ gii wɛki, be bɛ lɛ wuu. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Buu bɛniiŋ yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ, teeŋ be le bɔɔŋ bee bɛ nto-oŋ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se nuuŋ le biŋwaati bi fichi bimu kɛmi yɛ n'yɔru wu le, “Teeŋ be le bɔɔŋ bee bɛ nto-oŋ,” kɛ.</char></note> le ke ni nuuŋ bee be, tundi be be deŋgi be fenjisi jɛ yi Nyɔ, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>be ni be kɛmi tɛ buŋga bu buushɛ bɔɔŋ bɛ kiŋkundi-i li bɛniiŋ li.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biŋwaati bifichi bimu nuuŋ ɛ bɛ taa kintsii kini le “Be wɔnchi tɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ chigɔ-ɔŋ”.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Bɛniiŋ bɛlu tɛ̀ nuuŋ: Simu, wu tɛ nyɛ bukooŋ bwee bumu le Pita. <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>Jeeŋ bee ŋwaani wu Jɔɔŋ bɛ tɛ nuuŋ bɔɔŋ bɛ Dzɛbɛdii, bɛ tɛ̀ nyɛ mɛŋkooŋ mɛ bee le, “Bohanɛgɛs,” mɛ nuuŋ le, “Bɔɔŋ bɛ dzaaŋ yi wɛndi-i.” <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Bamu se nuuŋ Andolo, Fili, Batolomu, Maacho, Tomɛ, Jeeŋ wu ŋwanɛ Afiyus, Tajɔ, Simu wu tɛ nuuŋ wi wu kintutu ki Bɛsilɔ-ɔ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɛsilɔ tɛ̀ nuuŋ Bɛjuu bɛ tɛ̀ teendi kwɛɛŋ, be gwii le be buu bɛniiŋ li ŋgɛ li tsaŋ yi bɛniiŋ bɛ Lom.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>mɔɔ Judas Iskaliyɔ wu tɛ̀ wɛɛŋ kabɛ Jiso.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛniiŋ tɛ̀ kweŋgi le Bɛɛsɛbu wu mfɔŋ <optbreak/> wu bɔɔŋ bɛ kiŋkundi wɛ li Jiso-o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Maacho 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Jiso tɛ̀ dza gɛɛŋ fɛ tɛ̀ tsiiŋ, kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ tuu ki banchɛ fe, bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu se foo dze yi jɛ biee. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Le kini kee woo, ki gɛɛŋ le ki dzɔɔ wu kifɛ bɛniiŋ tɛ̀ kweŋgi le yoomfɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ tɛ̀ dza Jɛrosalɛŋ be bɔɔ le, be se tuu be tiiti le, “Bɛɛsɛbu wɛ li wuu bwiŋ, busɔɔ bɔɔŋ bɛ kiŋkundi-i ni, nuuŋ bɛ buŋga bu mfɔŋ wu bɛnchindaa wulu-u.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Jiso teeŋ be, bii li bee lɛ ŋgaŋgaa li laa, “Nuuŋ Sataŋ tuu ni busi yi yee li wi-i nindee? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Ɛ kitoŋ dza ki gatɛ ki gwii kiki, ki tɛ naa leŋ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Ɛ yih dza yi gatɛ yi gwii yi yi, yi tɛ naa leŋ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Nɛɛ lɛ, ɛ Sataŋ dza wu gatɛ bee kintutu kee bee be tuu be gwii li yi yi bee, be tɛ naa leŋ kɛ, ni nuuŋ kimɛrisɛ kee. <verse eid="MRK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>Nɛ kɛɛ le wih nuuŋ yɛ lu wu nuuŋ naa lɛ li yih yi wi wu buŋga-a, kotɛ biee biee chɛɛŋ letɛ bɛ bi, fuki fɛ wu saa wu kaŋ wi wu buŋga wulu, se kotɛ biee bi li mwɛ yi nsiŋ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>Ntee beŋ chɛɛŋ le, Nyɔ gii yi feeki bibifi mɔɔ jɛ́ yi bifi chichi yi bɛniiŋ tiiti kii yi. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Se nuuŋ le, ɛ wi kweeŋ jɛ yi bifi kii Fiana yi Waaŋ, Nyɔ nuuŋ tɛ naa feeki wɛɛ wi kɛ, kifɛ wu fɛɔ bubiɛɛ bu kimakɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Jiso tɛ̀ kweeŋ lɛ kifɛ bɛniiŋ bɛlu tɛ̀ kweŋgi le fiana yi tii yɛɛ li wuu bwiŋ.<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ni Jiso bee bɛŋwaani Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Maacho 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Ni Jiso bee bɛŋwaani Jiso biee be fɛsi, be leŋ lɛkuuŋ, be toŋ wi le mwɛ teeŋ wu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Ɛ kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ tɛ̀ shee yɛ ki kɛnɛ wu ki tasɛ. Be tee li wuu le, “Na bee bɛŋwaana biiti baa wɛ lɛkuuŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Jiso se bii laa, “Naaŋ bee bɛŋwaanɛŋ nuuŋ baŋ?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Si tɛ̀ bii lɛ bichɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ shee yɛ be kɛnɛ wu baa, tee le, “Baaŋ bɛnaaŋ bee bɛŋwaanɛŋ. <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Wi kwikwi wu feti fiee fi Nyɔ wɛki, ɛ wu wu nuuŋ ŋwaanɛŋ bɛ dzɛ́mi yɛŋ mɔɔ bɛnaaŋ.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ŋgaŋgaa kii wi wu tɛ̀ tumi ŋgɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Maacho 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Jiso tɛ̀ tuu bɛchi tiifi bɛniiŋ li libɛ-ɛ lichiŋ, ɛ kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ tɛ̀ banchɛ fe weseeŋ. Se dza lɛ shee nuuŋ lɛ ŋgo-o, kintutu kilu lemi li ŋgemɛ yi dzɔɔ li, lɛ bukaka. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Tɛ̀ tiifi be biee ŋge nuuŋ lɛ ŋgaŋgaa li. Dza wa ŋgaŋgaa chimu li bee le, <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>“Yikɛ yɛɛŋ nɛ woo, wi tɛ̀ la le gɛɛŋ tuŋ ŋgɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Le ni tumi, yimi weyɛ lɛ dze, muniiŋ bɛ mu chɔchɛ mu ji. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Yimi weyɛ fɛ kintsii ki ta-a, fɛ nshɛ nuuŋ yɛ fe ŋge kɛ. Yi biee yi bo kifɛ nshɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ yɛ fe bujɔŋ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Le wiiŋ bɛchi mbanu, wu sooŋ ŋgɔ yilu yi wɔɔbɛ, kifɛ yi tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ ki lii kɛ gɛɛŋ le yi seri kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Ŋgɔ yimi weyɛ li bifafu-u. Bifafu bilu ko bi baanyɛ ŋgɔ yilu yi se ba ŋ'wonu muntaaŋ nsiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Ŋgɔ yimi weyɛ nuuŋ li nshɛ yi dzeeŋ li, yi bo, yi ko, yi woŋ, yaa si bɛ tɛ̀ tuŋ, lii yi yimi woŋ muntaaŋ mbaanshɛɛ, yi yimi sháŋ mbaambusɔɔ, yimi sháŋ gwii.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Le Jiso wa lɛ biee mɛɛshi le, “Wi wu kɛmi bintooŋ mwɛ woo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fiee fi tɛ̀ fɛ Jiso se yeti nuuŋ lɛ ŋgaŋgaa li</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Maacho 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Jiso tɛ̀ nuuŋ wuu mbiiŋ, bɛniiŋ bamu bɛ bee be tɛ̀ nuuŋ mɔɔ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u bɛ yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ baa tɛ̀ bii li wuu kii ŋgaŋgaa chilu. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Tuu li bee le, “Ɛ li be-eŋ bɛ Nyɔ doonchɛ yɛ biee bi li bumfɔŋ bwee li bi nuuŋ lɛ munyiikɔɔ li. Se nuuŋ le, li bɛniiŋ bamu-u fiee fichu fiɛɛ nuuŋ lɛ ŋgaŋgaa li, <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>ke be se ni be bichi, be tɛ ŋɛŋ kɛ, be ni be yiki, be tɛ woo kɛ. Bee nuuŋ yɛ lɛ kɛ dɛɛŋ be fiiki shéŋ yibe, Nyɔ feeki bibifi bi bee.”<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fiee fi ŋgaŋgaa chi Jiso tɛ̀ wa chini doonchi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Maacho 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Jiso dza bii li bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ bɛ wu baa laa, “Fi nuuŋ le nɛ mɛɛŋ ki kɛɛ kɛ fiee fi ŋgaŋgaa chini tiiti kɛ ni? Ɛ nɛ mɛɛŋ ki kɛɛ kɛ chini kɛ, nɛ gii nɛ geeŋ nɛ se kɛɛ ŋgaŋgaa yimi? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Ŋgɔ yi wi wulu tɛ̀ tumi yɛ ɛ jɛ yi Nyɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Ŋgɔ yi tɛ̀ weyɛ lɛ dze yɛ nuuŋ bɛniiŋ bɛ wuki jɛ yi Nyɔ, Sataŋ se bɛ mfwaa mumkpaŋ buu jɛ yilu li shéŋ yibe. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Ŋgɔ yi tɛ̀ weyɛ fɛ kintsii ki ta-a yɛ nuuŋ bɛniiŋ bɛ wuki jɛ yi Nyɔ, be fi yi mfwaa mumkpaŋ bɛ kinɛɛtinɛ, <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>se nuuŋ le, yi tɛ̀ seri le yi gɛɛŋ li shéŋ yibee kɛ. Ɛ yi ŋɔɔnɛ niiŋ kwaa, ɛ ŋgɛ bɛ, kɛ ɛ bɛniiŋ biindi bikaa lɛ be jiŋ kii jɛ yilu, be chee bikaa lijiŋ mfwaa mumkpaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Ŋgɔ yi tɛ̀ weyɛ li bifafu-u yɛ nuuŋ bɛniiŋ bɛ wuki jɛ yi Nyɔ, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>bɛmbeechɛ kii biee bi li nshɛ yini-i, bɛ kiŋkɔŋgisɛ ki bunɔŋa-a mɔɔ biee bimu bɛ bi taashɛ bi baanyɛ jɛ yilu yi la li yee li. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Ŋgɔ yi tɛ̀ weyɛ li nshɛ yi dzeeŋ li yɛ nuuŋ bɛniiŋ bɛ wuki jɛ yi Nyɔ, be fi yi, be feti si yi wɛki be giiŋgi limfwe limfwe, nɛɛ si ŋgɔ, yi ti wundi muntaaŋ sháŋ mbaanshɛɛ, yimi sháŋ mbaambusɔɔ, yimi sháŋ gwii.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kii lambo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Jiso dza bii laa, “Wi ti lii bɛ lambo li yih kuuki bɛ ŋkaa, kɛ gɛɛ lintakwiiŋ ni? Ti lii nɛɛ tɔmi nuuŋ nɛɛ li fiee fi bɛ ti tɔɔmi lambo lu ni? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Nɛ ni nɛ kii le fiee fichu fi nuuŋ lɛ munyiikɔɔ li fiɛɛ ɛ bɛ tɛ̀ nyikɛ le bɛ naa bɛ yiiŋgi fi, fi nuuŋ lɛjiŋ lɛjiŋ fichu bɛ gii naa bɛ fɛ fi bo fɛ waaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Wi wu kɛmi bintooŋ, mwɛ woo.” <verse eid="MRK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Jiso tuu tee le, “Ɛ nɛ yiki jɛ yi Nyɔ nɛ yiki bujɔŋ, nɛ kɛɛ le dze yi wi yiki le ɛ yi yi Nyɔ gii naa yi fichɛ le se yi nyɛ li mwɛ, yi gii naa yi nyɛ yaa bu yawu. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Wi wu kɛmi fiee bɛ gii naa bɛ tondɛ. Wi wu kɛmi yɛ fiee kɛ, mɔɔ nuuŋ fi niiŋ fi kɛmi bɛ gii naa bɛ fi bu fiɛ li wu-u.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ŋgaŋgaa kii ŋgɔ si yi ti kuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Jiso tuu tee le, “Bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ nuuŋ si ŋgɔ yi wi tuŋ liwɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Ɛ nuuŋ butuu liiti, ɛ bu woo dza we. Ŋgɔ yilu se yi maŋ yi kuu, tɛ kɛɛ mɔɔ laa yi kuu niŋ le kɛ, <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>nuuŋ nshɛ yi feti yi se kuu. Ɛ yi kuu lɔɔ, yi dza yi tɔɔŋ, yi boo yi fɛ bikiiŋ, yi toŋ sháŋ. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Ɛ yi ta, dzɔ finyɔɔ lɛ liwɛ, kifɛ mfi wu ŋ'wechɛ kɔchɔɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ŋgaŋgaa kii ŋwaani ŋgɔ yi fintaaŋ fimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Maacho 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Jiso tuu dza tee le, “Tɛɛbeŋ nuuŋ tɛ maa bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ bɛ la? Tɛ nuuŋ tɛ maa bu bɛ ŋgaŋgaa chi la? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Bu bwɛɛ si ŋwaani ŋgɔ yi fintaaŋ fimu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fintaaŋ fini nuuŋ lɛ jɛ́ yi bala le, “mustard”.</char></note> yi sendɛ yi yaa ŋgɔ́ chichi yi laaŋkwiiŋ. Ɛ wi tuŋ liwɛ, <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>yi ko, yi yaa biti bichu bi bɛ ti tumi liwɛ, yi nyɛ yɛ́ŋɛ yi nyɔŋa, yi fɛ kiyuundɛ ki muniiŋ mu jiindi liwe nuuŋ mu gwanyɛ yíh li kiyuundɛ ki yɛ́ŋɛ yilu-u.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Ɛ lɛ si Jiso tɛ̀ gii fenjisi jɛ yi Nyɔ li bɛniiŋ li lɛ ŋgaŋgaa li si yini, si nuuŋ be woo. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Tɛ̀ gii tiiti yɛ fiee li bee fuki lɛ ŋgaŋgaa li nsiŋ kɛ. Se nuuŋ le, ɛ nuuŋ bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u be be, se mɛɛshi naanyɛ ŋgaŋgaa yilu chichi li bee.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso waŋ mfiee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Maacho 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Jiso tɛ̀ gii tiifi bɛniiŋ booyaa, le ni nuuŋ lɛ fɛmfo-o, tee li bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u le, “Tɛɛbeŋ tɛ lenchi libɛ tɛ gɛɛŋ luwiŋ lɔɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Be shɛ kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ ki tɛ̀ nuuŋ fe, be lɛ lɛ ŋgo-o wu Jiso tɛ nuuŋ le wɛɛ, bee be se lenchi, bɛŋgo bamu biki be. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Si be tɛ̀ leenchi lɛ, kiŋkuŋku ki tɛɛmi bɛchi ki nduŋgi bɛ dzɔɔ, dzɔɔ lɛ lɛ ŋgo-o yi wɛki le yi yisɛ le. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Jiso tɛ̀ nuuŋ lɛ kinyi ki ŋgo-o liiti, ɛ wu gɛɛ kikoo kee li fiee fi miɔɔfi-i liwe. Be gɛɛŋ be kaŋgisi wu be tiiti le, “Wi wu ntiifɛ, kwe wɛki yɛ le yi dzɔɔ bee ni ɔ tɛ boo kɛ ni?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Jiso kaaŋgi, waŋ kiŋkuŋku kilu, tee li dzɔɔ li le, “Chikɛ nshiiŋ.” Kiŋkuŋku kilu biee ki chikɛ, bintsii se dɛŋ ni nshiiŋŋ. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Bii li bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu laa, “Nɛ chɛndi la? Nɛ mɛɛŋ ki gɛɛ kɛ shéŋ li mi-i kɛ ni?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Be kɛmɛ chɛnɛ, se be yeti bebe laa, “Wuni wi nuuŋ niŋ, wu kiŋkuŋku mɔɔ dzɔɔ wuki li wuu?” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus rebuke the wind" file="DN00435b.tif" size="col" loc="4:39-41" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="4:41">Jiso waŋ kiŋkuŋku</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Jiso buu bɔɔŋ bɛ kiŋkundi-i li wi-i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Maacho 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u lenchi libɛ chilu be bo liwiŋ, kimbɛ ki bɛniiŋ bɛ Jerasɛnɛ-ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Si tɛ̀ buti lɛ ŋgo-o lɛ, bee wumu wu fiana yi tii tɛ̀ ŋwɛki bɛ mwɛ, ɛ wu bo lɛ dzíŋ yi bɛ tɛ̀ diyi bɛniiŋ le-e. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Wi wulu tɛ̀ tsiiŋ lɛ dzíŋ yilu-u. Wi tɛ̀ nuuŋ yɛ lu wu nuuŋ mɔɔ kaŋ wu bɛ bɛ ncha kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Kiŋga ŋge tɛ̀ nuuŋ ɛ bɛ gɛɛ wu li bɛmfaŋgɛ-ɛ, bɛ kaŋ tsaŋ yee bɛ bɛncha, soomɛ bɛncha bɛlu, shaanshɛ bɛmfaŋgɛ bɛlu. Wi tɛ̀ nuuŋ yɛ lu wu nuuŋ mɔɔ kɛmɛ li wuu kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Wi wulu tɛ̀ shiiŋ deŋgi lɛ dzíŋ yilu-u buti michi li bɛŋkumɛ-ɛ butuu bɛ fɛnshaaŋ, dzɛŋgi, kwaashi yi yee li ta-a.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Le ŋɛŋ Jiso mɛɛŋ mfiiŋ, letɛ bɛ toŋ núŋ wu limfwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>dzaaŋ lɛwe le, “Jiso ŋwanɛ Nyɔ, Nyɔ yi nuuŋ Kikoo ki Biee Bichu-u, ɔ wɛki la li mi-i? Nlɛkɔɔ wɛ li bukooŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ le kiiŋ ɔ ni nyɛ ŋgɛ li mi-i kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Tɛ̀ tiiti lɛ, kifɛ Jiso bee saa wu dzaaŋ le, “Fiana yi tii yini, bochɛ li wi wuni.” <verse eid="MRK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Jiso se bii li wuu laa, “Bukooŋ bwo nuuŋ le noo.” Tuu le, “Bukooŋ bweŋ nuuŋ le kiyaŋ, kifɛ tɛ̀ yaŋ ŋge.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Le tuu lɛ, bɔsɛyi sooŋ bɔ li Jiso le kiiŋ ni kooŋ bɛ be kimbɛ kilu kɛ.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Fi tɛ̀ nuuŋ lɛ ɛ kintutu ki nɔŋa ki dziiŋ lɛ tɛ̀ jii biee li mbɛmɛ wu ŋkumɛ-ɛ fe. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Fiana yi tii yilu lɛkɛ Jiso le, “Tuumi bee nuuŋ li dzíiŋ yɛɛ, tɛ̀ lɛ li yi-i.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Jiso beŋ. Fiana yi tii yilu bo li wi wulu-u, yi gɛɛŋ yi lɛ li dzíiŋ yilu-u. Kintutu ki dzíiŋ lɛ kilu tɛ̀ nuuŋ si bɛnchuki bɛfɛ. Yi letɛ, yi bɔɔ li mbɛmɛ wɛɛ, yi seri lɛ libɛ-ɛ yi kwiyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ kiichi dzíiŋ yilu se dza fe, be kifi, be gɛɛŋ be tee ntoŋ wulu li bito-oŋ mɔɔ li bintsii bi fe-e. Bɛniiŋ tɛ̀ wuki, be buti be bɛɛ le be ŋɛŋ fiee fi tɛ̀ kɛti. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Le be bɛ fɛ Jiso tɛ̀ nuuŋ, be ŋɛŋ wi wu kiyaŋ ki bɔɔŋ bɛ kiŋkundi-i tɛ̀ shiiŋ be ŋwɛki bɛ wu wɛ, ɛ wu shee fe, wu lii ndu, bufii bwee kaari bu to tsaaŋ. Be chɛŋ ŋge. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ ŋɛŋ fiee fi tɛ̀ ka, se tiiti si fi tɛ̀ ka bɛ wi wulu mɔɔ kintutu ki dzíiŋ lɛ kilu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Le be woo lɛ, be lɛkɛ Jiso le dza li kwɛɛŋ wu bee.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Le Jiso ni lii lɛ ŋgo-o, wi wu bɔɔŋ bɛ kiŋkundi-i tɛ̀ bo li wuu bwiŋ wɛ bɛchi lɛki Jiso le bee wu ni be giiŋgi. <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Jiso faaŋ, tee li wuu le, “Ɔ giiŋgi nuuŋ fɛkuuŋ, ɔ gɛɛŋ ɔ tee li bɛniiŋ bo-o fiee fi Taa fɛ li wɛ-ɛ, bɛ si wu kɔɔ ɔ nshiiŋ bɛ wɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Se nuuŋ le, wi wulu tɛ̀ dza gɛɛŋ, deŋgi li kwɛɛŋ wu bɛ teenyi le Bitoŋ bi Yoofi wɛɛ kwikwi, tiiti fiee fi Jiso fɛ li wuu. Bɛniiŋ tɛ̀ wuki, be tɛti maa.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kii ŋwanɛ Jairɔs mɔɔ kwɛɛŋ wumu <optbreak/> wu tɛ̀ koŋ li ndu yi Jiso tɛmi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Maacho 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Jiso tuu kaari lenchi lɛ ŋgo-o gɛɛŋ luwiŋ lɔɔ nuuŋ li libɛ lichiŋ, kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ tuu ki banchɛ fe. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Te Kikoo wu yih yi nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ wumu tɛ̀ dza bɛ fe, bukooŋ bwee nuuŋ le Jairɔs. Le ŋɛŋ Jiso, gɛɛŋ we wu limfwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>bɔsɛyi suŋgi bɔ li wuu tiiti le, “Ŋwanɛŋ wu kwɛɛŋ wu bwi wɛ lɛ kwe wa. Mintemii, bɛ ɔ koŋ li wuu tɛmi kii ni kwi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Jiso se dza bee wu gɛɛŋ, kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ banchɛ ki biki ki fachi Jiso.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Kwɛɛŋ wumu tɛ̀ nuuŋ li kintutu kilu-u linti, ɛ wu gɔŋ bɛ chigɔŋ chi mfi wu ŋɛnɛ-ɛ biya yoofi ntsɔ bifɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Tɛ̀ fiɔɔŋ ŋge li bɛniiŋ bɛ ntsi-i, biifi fiee fichu fi tɛ̀ kɛmi, biee se biiti bi giiŋgi bu limfwe-e. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Si tɛ̀ woo kii Jiso, biee lɛ wuu jiŋ li kintutu kɛɛ linti, koŋ li ndu yee, <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>kifɛ tɛ̀ tee li shéŋ yee li le, “Ɛ mi ŋkoŋ nɛɛ mɔɔ nuuŋ li ndu ye kwaa, kɛ mi ntɛmɔɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Si tɛ̀ koŋ lɛ, mfi wu ŋɛŋgɛ we biee wu ma mfwaa mumkpaŋ. Kwɛɛŋ wulu woo tɛ li yi yee li le, wu tɛmɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Jiso woo li yi yee li le, buŋga bo bwɛɛ li wuu, fiiki yi mfwaa mumkpaŋ, bii li bɛniiŋ li laa, “Ɛ noo wu koŋ li ndu yɛɛŋ?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu tuu li wuu le, “Ɔ ŋiŋgi yɛ si kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ fachi wɛ, ɔ tuu ɔ biiti wi wu koŋ li wɛ-ɛ ni?” <verse eid="MRK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Jiso ba bichi kɛnini le ŋɛŋgɛ wi wu koŋ li wuu. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Nɛɛlɛ si kwɛɛŋ wulu tɛ̀ kɛɛ fiee fi ka bɛ wu, biee bɛ, chɛndi, kɛɛti, toŋ núŋ li Jiso limfwe tee chɛɛŋ we kwikwi li wuu. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Jiso tee li wuu le, “Ŋwanɛŋ, shéŋ yɔɔ gɛɛ li mi-i, fɛ yɛɛ ɔ tɛmi. Ɔ giiŋgi bujɔŋ. Chigɔŋ cho ma chɛɛ kituŋ.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Nɛɛ si Jiso tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ yeti li kwɛɛŋ wulu-u lɛ, bɛniiŋ bamu fɛsi ɛ be dza fɛ Jairɔs kuuŋ wu te kikoo ki yih yi nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ wɛ, be tee li wuu le, “Ŋwana mɛɛshɔɔ. Ɛ la fi ɔ fieŋgisi Wi wu Ntiifɛ?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Si be tee lɛ, Jiso woo, se nuuŋ le, tɛ̀ fɛ kɛɛ mɛɛŋɔ ki woo kɛ, tee li Jairɔs le, “Kiiŋ ɔ ni ɔ chɛndi kɛ, gɛɛ shéŋ ya nuuŋ li mi-i kwaa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Be ba be ŋgiiŋgi, Jiso mɛɛŋ ki beŋ le wumu biee wu kɛ, fuki Pita bɛ Jeeŋ mɔɔ Jɔɔŋ wu ŋwaani Jeeŋ nsiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Le be gɛɛŋ be fɛsi fɛ Jairɔs kuuŋ, Jiso ŋɛŋ si bɛniiŋ yɛti fe bɛ kwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Lɛ li yih, bii laa, “Nɛ dii, nɛ fieŋgisi bintsii ni kii la? Ŋwaŋ wulu mɛɛŋɔ ki kwi-i kɛ, liitɔɔ bu lefu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Be kee wu bu kefu. Dza buu bɛniiŋ bɛchu lɛkuuŋ, dzɔ nuuŋ te ŋwaŋ bɛ ni ŋwaŋ mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u bɛ bɛtɛɛtu baa, bee be lɛ be gɛɛŋ fɛ ŋwaŋ wulu tɛ gimi. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Kɛmɛ ŋwaŋ wulu li kibɛnɛ-ɛ, yɔ lɛ jɛ́ yi bee le, “Talita kum!” Fi nuuŋ le, “Ŋwaakwɛɛŋ, n'yetɔɔ li wɛ-ɛ, dza we.” <verse eid="MRK 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Mfwaa mumkpaŋ, dza we deŋgi. Ŋwaakwɛɛŋ wulu tɛ̀ nuuŋ biya yoofi ntsɔ bifɛ. Le be ŋɛŋ lɛ wa tɛ be. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Jiso chiinsɛ li bee mkpaaŋ le, kiiŋ be ni fɛ wi kɛɛ fiee fi bee fi nuuŋ kɛ, se tee le be nyɛ wu fiee ji.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Bɛ faaŋ Jiso li kitoŋ kee li</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Maacho 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Jiso tɛ̀ dza fe, bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u gɛɛŋ li kitoŋ kee li. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Le ni nuuŋ jobɛ chibee chi bɛshiinshi, gɛɛŋ li yih yi nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ bɛchi tiifi bɛniiŋ lu. Bɛniiŋ ŋgee bɛ tɛ̀ wuki si tiifi, wa tɛ tii be. Be tuu be dza be njanji be tiiti le, “Wi wuni laanchɛ bini biee nuuŋ fɛŋ? Wu dzɔ buni bufii fɛŋ? Wu ge niŋ se feti bini biŋkoofɛyi bi biee lɛ? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Ɛ nɛɛ wu, wi wu keendi biti wu nuuŋ ŋwanɛ Maariya ni? Nuuŋ nɛɛ ŋwaani Jeeŋ bee Jɔsɛ mɔɔ Judas bee Simu ni? Mɔɔ bɛŋwaani bɛ buŋkɛɛŋ nuuŋ nɛɛ fɛni bɛ bee ni?” Si be tee lɛ be faaŋ wu. <verse eid="MRK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Se nuuŋ le Jiso tɛ̀ tee li bee le, “Bɛ ti guundi ntomfɔŋ wu Nyɔ li bintsii bichu. Ɛ nɛɛ li kwɛɛŋ we-e li kwaa bɛ li kini kee li, mɔɔ li wuu yih, li bɛ ti guundi yɛ wu kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Si be tɛ̀ faaŋ Jiso lɛ, fi yaa wu fɛ nuuŋ tuu fɛ biŋkoofɛyi bi biee lɛ fe ŋge, fuki nɛɛ le tɛ̀ koŋ li bɛniiŋ bɛ chigɔ-ɔŋ niiŋ be tɛmi nsiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Fi yaa wu fɛ be tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ ki gɛɛ kɛ shéŋ li wuu kɛ.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Jiso toŋ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu bɛ yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Maacho 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Jiso dza fe deŋgi li bitoŋ bi fe-e, tiifi bɛniiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Dza teeŋ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u bɛ yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ baa, tundi be lɛkuuŋ bɛfɛ bɛfɛ, nyɛɛ buŋga li bee bu buushɛ fiana yi tii li bɛniiŋ li lu. <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>Le ni tundi be tee le kiiŋ be ni dzɔɔ fiee fuki kimbaaŋ siŋ kɛ. Kiiŋ be ni dzɔɔ biee bijɛ kɛ. Kiiŋ be ni dzɔɔ babi, kɛ kwa li bitsaa bi bee kɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Be tɛ̀ shiiŋ be giki kwa lɛ bitsaa li.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Le be liishɛ bikpɔ, se nuuŋ le kiiŋ be ni chuumɛ biŋkoŋ bi fɛɛtu kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Se tuu tee li bee le, “Mfi wu nɛ gɛɛŋ li kito-oŋ, nɛ lɛ li yih, nɛ tsiiŋ lu gɛɛŋ bo jobɛ chi nɛ dzɛti fe. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Ɛ kitoŋ kimu faaŋ le ki fii yɛ beŋ kɛ, mɔɔ le ki wuki yɛ fiee fi nɛ tiiti kɛ, nɛ dza fe, mfi wu nɛ dzɛti lɔɔ nɛ kachɛ kiboŋ ki li bikaa binɛ-ɛ, le fi doonchɛ fiee fi be mɔŋ.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biŋwaati bi fichi bimu taa fɛni le, “Ntee li beŋ chɛɛŋ le gii ni nuuŋ jobɛ chi nsa wu kimakɛ, biee gii bi biaaŋ li kitoŋ ki Sɔdɔm bɛ ki Gomora ya kitoŋ kilu.”</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Nɛɛlɛ, be dza be gɛɛŋ be fenjisi le bɛniiŋ fiiki shéŋ yibe. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Be tuu be buushi tɛ bɔɔŋ bɛ biŋkundi-i ŋge li bɛniiŋ li, be tsiti bɛniiŋ bɛ chigɔŋ ŋge bɛ mɛɛŋ, be wɔnchi be.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Si bɛ tɛ̀ wo Jɔɔŋ Nlisulidzɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Maacho 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Le Mfɔŋ Hɛrɔ woo ntoŋ wu kii Jiso, si bɛniiŋ tɛ̀ wuki bukooŋ bwee li bintsii bichu-u, bɛniiŋ bamu tiiti le, “Jiso wuni nuuŋ Jɔɔŋ Nlisulidzɔɔ wu tɛ̀ kaari wu bo li kwe-e. Fiɛɛ fiee fi feti se kɛmi buŋga bu fɛrɛ biee bi koofi yi bini ni.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Bamu tiiti le, “Ɛ Ɛlaja wu tɛ̀ kaari wu bɛ.” Bamu le, “Ɛ ntomfɔŋ wu Nyɔ wumu si bɛ lindɛɛri.” <verse eid="MRK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Le Hɛrɔ woo biee bini ni, tee fiee le, “Ɛ Jɔɔŋ Nlisulidzɔɔ, wu ntɛ̀ ŋka kikoo kee wu kaari wu bo li kwe-e.”<verse eid="MRK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Hɛrɔ tɛ̀ toŋ bɛniiŋ be gɛɛŋ be kɔɔ wu, be kaŋ be bɛŋɛ wu li yih yi ncha-a, kii Hɛroja wu kwɛɛ Fili wu ŋwaani Hɛrɔ, wu Hɛrɔ tɛ̀ dzɔ li kwɛsi-i. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Jɔɔŋ tɛ̀ fɛŋgi tiiti li wuu le, “Nchi mɛɛŋ ki beŋ kɛ le wi dzɔɔ kwɛɛ ŋwaani si kwɛsi kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Si Jɔɔŋ tɛ̀ tee lɛ, Hɛroja gɛɛ wu lɛ shéŋ, wɛki le wo wu, le fi ni fi nuuŋ ni, se nuuŋ le tɛ̀ kɛmi yɛ dze kɛ, <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>kifɛ Hɛrɔ tɛ̀ chɛndi Jɔɔŋ le ɛ wi wu waaŋ tuu nuuŋ tɛ̀ wi wu Nyɔ. Se tuu ŋɛŋ le kiiŋ be ni wo wu kɛ. Mfi wu Hɛrɔ tɛ̀ shiiŋ yiki fiee fi Jɔɔŋ tiiti, shéŋ yee wɛsini ŋge, se nuuŋ le tɛ̀ kɔŋgisi nɛɛ le ni yiki fiee fi tiiti. <verse eid="MRK 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Dze tɛ̀ dza yi yenɛ li Hɛroja-a, jobɛ chimu chi Hɛrɔ tɛ̀ feti tsɔnɔ bee bɛte kwɛɛŋ mɔɔ bikoo bi nchi-i mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa bɛ Galilii, le kimi jobɛ chi bɛ tɛ̀ biɛ wu. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Ŋwanɛ Hɛroja wu kwɛɛŋ lɛ bwachɛ binɛ, chi dzɔɔŋ fɛ Hɛrɔ bee bɛniiŋ bee bɛ tsɔnɔ. Se tee li ŋwaŋ wulu le, “Bii fiee fiɔɔ kɔŋgisi, mfenyɔɔ lu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Se tuu chini tee le, “Ɔɔ bii mɔɔ nuuŋ la li mi-i le, mɔɔ nuuŋ kiŋgatɛ ki kwɛɛŋ wɛ-ɛŋ, kɛ ŋgii nyɛ wɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Ŋwaŋ wu kwɛɛŋ wulu se bo gɛɛŋ bii li ni-i laa, “Ntee le mfenyɛ mi bɛ la?” Ni se tuu le, “Gɛnɛ ɔ tee le bɛ nyɛ wɛ kikoo ki Jɔɔŋ Nlisulidzɔɔ li.” <verse eid="MRK 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Se bakɛ to lijiŋ mfwaa mumkpaŋ, tee li Mfɔŋ Hɛrɔ le, “Ŋwɛkɔɔ le ɔ nyɛ mi kikoo ki Jɔɔŋ Nlisulidzɔɔ li dɛɛni fɛ kintɛkɛ-ɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Mfɔŋ woo lɛ, yi kwi wu ŋge. Se nuuŋ le, si tɛ̀ chini limfwe li bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ fɛ tsɔnɔ-ɔ, tɛ̀ wɛki yɛ le tuu fiiki jɛ ye yi bee tee li ŋwaŋ wulu-u kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Se biee toŋ nchindaa we mfwaa mumkpaŋ le gɛɛŋ bɛ bɛ kikoo ki Jɔɔŋ lɛ. Gɛɛŋ li yih yi ncha-a, ka kikoo ki Jɔɔŋ lɛ, <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>Bɛ bɛ ki fɛ kintɛkɛ-ɛ, bɛ nyɛ li ŋwaakwɛɛŋ wulu-u. Fi, bo gɛɛŋ nyɛ li ni-i. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Le bɔɔŋ bɛ kintutu-u bɛ Jɔɔŋ lɛ wuki lɛ, be gɛɛŋ be dzɔ gwini chi Jɔɔŋ lɛ be diyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso nyɛkɛ bɛniiŋ bɛnchuki bɛtiinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Maacho 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jɔɔŋ 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Bɔɔŋ bɛ ntoŋ bɛ Jiso tɛ̀ dɛndɛ be kaari be to lijiŋ lɛ wuu, be tee wu biee bichu bi be tɛ̀ fɛ, bɛ bi be tɛ̀ tiifi bɛniiŋ lu li wuu. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Se dza tee li bee le, “Bɛ yɛɛŋ, beŋ beŋ tɛ̀ gɛɛŋ fɛ kintsii ki bɛniiŋ nuuŋ yɛ fe kɛ-ɛ, tɛ fufɛ niiŋ.” Tɛ̀ tee lɛ kifɛ bɛniiŋ ŋge tɛ̀ bɛɛ fɛ be tɛ̀ nuuŋ, bamu tɛ̀ bɛɛ, bamu karisi. Be tɛ̀ kɛmi yɛ dze yi be nuuŋ mɔɔ be ji biee kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Bee be lɛ lɛ ŋgo-o be cheekiyi, be gɛɛŋ fɛ kintsii ki bɛniiŋ tɛ̀ nuuŋ yɛ fe kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Se nuuŋ le, bɛniiŋ ŋge tɛ̀ ŋɛŋ nɛɛ be si be giiŋgi, be kɛɛ be, be dza li bintsii li bichu be letini be giiŋgi be soomi be limfwe. Le be gɛɛŋ be fɛsi fe, Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u se fɛsi tɛ̀. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Le bo lɛ ŋgo ni fɛɛshi li buka, ŋɛŋ kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ turi fe ni mamama, nshiiŋ kɔɔ wu bɛ be, kifɛ be tɛ̀ nuuŋ si nshɔ́ɔŋ yi nuuŋ yɛ bɛ kiŋkiichɛ kɛ. Se bɛchi tiifi be, tiifi be biee ŋge tɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Le jobɛ bɛchi chi ni chi sechi, bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u kiiŋgi li wuu lichiŋ, be tee li wuu le, “Fɛni fɛɛ fɛbuka mfi gɛɛŋɔ kituŋ, <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>gɛɛ bɛniiŋ bani be gɛɛŋ li bito-oŋ bɛ bɛla bɛ tsɛkɛtsɛkɛ, be go biee bi bee bijɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Se nuuŋ le Jiso tuu fiee le, “Beŋ kibɛɛ nyɛ yɛɛŋ be fiee be ji.” Be bii li wuu laa, “Ɔ wɛki le tɛ gɔɔŋ bɛdanali gii fɛɛ tɛ go biee bijɛ lu, tɛ bɛ tɛ nyɛ li bee ni?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Jiso bii li bee laa, “Nɛ kɛmi baa bibele bimɛ? Gɛnɛ yɛɛŋ nɛ bichɛ.” Le be gɛɛŋ be bichɛ, be tee le, “Tsee yi bibele yɛɛ shiŋ bɛ nsúuŋ fiɛɛtu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Jiso se tee li bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu le be tee le, bɛniiŋ bɛlu shee yɛ li bintutu-u li bintutu-u, li ntsɛɛ li. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Le bɛniiŋ bɛlu shee yɛ fɛkwiiŋ li bintutu-u gwii gwii li bamu mbaanshiŋ mbaanshiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Jiso fi tsée yi bibele yi shiŋ yɛɛ bɛ nsúuŋ yi fiɛɛtu yɛɛ, bichɛ liwe, nyɛ kiyɔɔni li Nyɔ-ɔ, booyɛ nyɛ li bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u, be gachɛ li bɛniiŋ bɛlu-u. Se gachɛ tɛ nsúuŋ yi fiɛɛtu yɛɛ li be bɛchu-u. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Bɛniiŋ bɛchu ji be fukɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Bɔɔŋ bɛ Jiso bɛ kintutu-u banchɛ muŋkɛ mu bibele mwɛɛ bɛ biŋkɛ bi nsúuŋ lɛ biɛɛ, bi yisɛ bɛŋkaa yoofi ntsɔ bifɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ ji bibele bilu tɛ nuuŋ buniŋ kwaa bɛnchuki bɛtiinu.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso dɛndɛ li dzɔɔ li liwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Maacho 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Jɔɔŋ 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Jiso se tee li bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u le be lɛ lɛ ŋgo-o be saa be gɛɛŋ limfwe Besaida le shɛ yɛsi bɛniiŋ bɛlu be ni be kuuki. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Shɛ yɛsi be, dza yɛɛ li ŋkumɛ-ɛ, le lɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Le lɛkuuŋ jiŋ, ɛ ŋgo wulu tɛ̀ nuuŋ dzɔɔ kintikinti kituŋ, Jiso mɛɛŋ nɛɛ libuka wuu mbiiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Ŋɛŋ si bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u gwenini bɛ ŋgo wu chefɛ, kifɛ mbaandze tɛ̀ bɛɛ dze limfwe fɛɛti wu. Ɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ si lɛ ŋwori lɛ se dza bɛɛ fɛ bee, deŋgi li dzɔɔ li liwe. Tɛ̀ bɛɛ wɛki le ka li bee lichiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Le be ŋɛŋ si deŋgi li dzɔɔ li liwe, be beechi le ɛ ŋkuubee. Be waŋ lɛwe, <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>kifɛ be bɛchu tɛ̀ ŋɛŋ wu jaaŋ kɔɔ be. Mfwaa mumkpaŋ, Jiso yɔ li bee, tee li bee le, “Kɛmɛ yɛɛŋ shéŋ, ɛ mi. Kiiŋ nɛ ni chɛŋ kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Si wu tee lɛ, se lɛ shee lɛ ŋgo-o bee be, mbaandze wulu biee wu chikɛ. Be nɛŋ ni, bimfimu wondɛ be ni kataraa, <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>be ti mɛɛŋ ki kɛɛ kɛ tɛ fiee fi tsee yi bibele yɛɛ tɛ̀ doonchi kii Jiso kɛ kifɛ be tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ ki gwiyɛ kɛ shéŋ yi be kɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso wɔnchɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ chigɔ-ɔŋ Jɛnɛsarɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Maacho 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Le be lenchi libɛ be bo kimbɛ ki Jɛnɛsarɛ, be shiŋɛ ŋgo li ŋgemɛ yi dzɔɔ li. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Le be bo lɛ ŋgo-o, bɛniiŋ kɛɛ Jiso mfwaa mumkpaŋ, <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>be bɛchi be letini be giiŋgi li bitoŋ bi fe bichu-u, be busi bɛniiŋ bɛ chigɔ-ɔŋ, be tuuti bɛniiŋ bɛ chigɔ-ɔŋ fɛ bida-aŋ fɛ kintsii kichu ki be woo le Jiso wɛ fe. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Kintsii kichu ki Jiso gɛɛŋ fe, mɔɔ nuuŋ fɛ kintsii li mɔɔ nuuŋ fɛ kito-oŋ, mɔɔ nuuŋ libuka, bɛniiŋ giki bɛniiŋ bɛ chigɔ-ɔŋ fɛ bɛniiŋ ti taashi. Mfi wu Jiso kɛtɔɔ, be lɛki le gɛɛ be koŋ mɔɔ nuuŋ li wooŋ wu ndu yee. Wi kwikwi wu tɛ̀ kundi, tɛ̀ tɛmi.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Bɛnchi bɛ wiwoŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Maacho 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Jobɛ chimu Bɛfarasii bɛ bɛniiŋ bamu bɛ tɛ̀ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ dza Jɛrosalɛŋ be bɛ be banchɛ li Jiso-o lichiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Be dza be ŋɛŋ bɔɔŋ bɛ kintutu-u bɛ Jiso-o bamu jii biee tsaŋ tii, fi nuuŋ le be ti mɛɛŋ ki tsootsɛ kɛ tsaŋ kɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Be tɛ̀ kɛmi le be tsootsɛ tsaŋ yini lɛ dze yi ntsɛ wube wu kwɛɛŋ wɛki.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Bɛfarasii mɔɔ Bɛjuu bɛchu tɛ̀ biki nuuŋ ntsɛ wu kwɛɛŋ wu bɛ tee bɛ bee bɛ ŋkosi, le nuuŋ wi tɛ̀ ji biee fuki fɛ mwɛ tsootsɛ tsaŋ nɛɛ si bɛ tɛ̀ shiiŋ bɛ tsootsi nsiŋ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Le nuuŋ wi tɛ̀ ji tɛ fiee fɛ mwɛ koo fɛwaŋ fuki fɛ wu tsootsɛ bikaa bɛ tsaŋ yee lɛ dze yi lu nsiŋ kɛ. Be tuu be feti biee bimu bi ntsɛ wu kwɛɛŋ lɛ ŋge, si ntsootsɛ muka bɛ bibɛɛŋ mɔɔ sháŋ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biŋwaati bi fichi bimu biɛɛ ɛ bɛ taa fe le, “…mɔɔ bidaŋ bi be tɛ̀ shiiŋ be yimi lu be se jii biee.”</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Bɛfarasii bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi bɛlu tɛ̀ bii li Jiso laa, “Ɛ kii la fi bɔɔŋ bo bɛ kintutu biki yɛ ntsɛ wu kwɛɛŋ wu bɛtaa bɛsɛŋ bɛ ŋkosi kɛ? Ɛ kii la fi be jii biee tsaŋ tii?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Jiso tuu li bee le, “Ɛsaya ntomfɔŋ wu Nyɔ tɛ̀ tee chɛɛŋ kii beŋ le nɛ baa bɛniiŋ bɛ nimi-i. Nɛ feti baa nɛɛ nuuŋ fiee fi bɛ tɛ̀ tsɛɛ, Nyɔ tiiti le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Bɛniiŋ bani guundi mi nuuŋ bɛ bimfimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">shéŋ yibe nuuŋ mfiiŋ li mi-i.<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Be guundi mi nuuŋ li yee li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">kifɛ be dzeti biee bi bɛniiŋ beechi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">be tiifi le ɛ jɛ yɛŋ’.<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>Ɛ nɛɛ lɛ si nɛ chiiŋgi baa bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ, nɛ kichi nuuŋ bɛ bɛniiŋ gɛɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Jiso se tee li bee le, “Nɛ gbɛŋgi nɛ kii faŋu bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ le se nɛ ni nɛ biki nuuŋ bɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Fi fiɛɛ ɛ Mɔɔsɛ tɛ̀ tee le, ‘Yooki chaa bee na.’ Tuu tee tɛ le, ‘Ɛ wi gaa tee kɛ ni, bɛ wo mwɛ dududu.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Se nuuŋ le, nɛ tiiti baa finɛ le, ‘Ɛ wi dza wu tee li tee li kɛ li ni-i le fiee fi bee nuuŋ wu fi tee kɛ ni lu, le fiee filu to fiɛɛ Kɔbaŋ,’ fi nuuŋ le fi to fiɛɛ fiee fi Nyɔ-ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>kɛ mɛɛŋ yɛ beŋ le dzɔɔ fiee filu fi tee kɛ ni lu kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Nɛ feti baa lɛ, nɛ feti jɛ yi Nyɔ tuu fiee fi yee kii ntsɛ wunɛ wu kwɛɛŋ, wu nɛ tiifi bɛniiŋ lu. Biee bimu se biɛɛ tɛ lu ŋge si bini bi nɛ feti.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fiee fi nuuŋ fi liibi wi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Maacho 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Jiso dza tuu teeŋ bɛniiŋ le be bɛ, tee li bee le, “Beŋ bɛchu yikɛ yɛɛŋ nɛ woo fiee fi ntiiti, nɛ kɛɛ bujɔŋ. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Fiee fimu nuuŋ yɛ lu lɛkuuŋ fi nuuŋ fi lɛ li wi-i fi liibi wi kɛ. Ɛ fiee fi buti li wi-i, fi nuuŋ fi liibi wi. [<verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>Wi wu kɛmi bintooŋ le woo, mwɛ woo.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se nuuŋ le biŋwaati bi fichi bimu kɛmiyɛ kiŋkɛ ki 16 kini kɛ.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Jiso shɛ bɛniiŋ bɛlu, lɛ li yih, bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u bii li wuu kii ŋgaŋgaa chilu. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Tuu li bee le, “Nɛ kii yɛ biee tɛ ni? Kɛ nɛ kii yɛ le fiee fichu fi wi lisi lɛ wuu wa nuuŋ tɛ biifi wu kɛ ni? <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Fi nuuŋ lɛ, kifɛ fi ti lii yɛ le fi gɛɛŋ nuuŋ li shé-eŋ kɛ, fi sɛchi nuuŋ lɛ shéŋ, fi se dɛndɛ fi bo.” (Si Jiso tɛ̀ tee lɛ, fi se nuuŋ le biee bijɛ bichu biɛɛ waaŋ.) <verse eid="MRK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Tuu gɛɛŋ limfwe tee le, “Ɛ fiee fi buti li wi-i, fi bifisi mwɛ, <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>kifɛ biee bichu bibifi bi wi feti dzɛti nuuŋ li shéŋ yee li. Biee si bɛmbeechɛ bɛ bifi, kii bukwɛɛ, n'yɛ buyi, ŋ'wo wi, ŋgimu bɛ kwɛɛ wi kɛ nyumɛ wi, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>nsɔmfu biee, ŋkɛmɛ tee chi bifi mfɛru kimfi, mfɛru nyɛŋ, ŋkɛmɛ shéŋ yi yɛɛti, mɛŋkooŋ mɛ bɛniiŋ lɛ mɛ bifisɛ, ntsakisɛ yi mɔɔ n'yoomfɛ kiyoomfɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Biee bibifi bini bichu dzɛti nuuŋ li shéŋ yi wi-i bi se bifisi mwɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shéŋ yi kwɛɛŋ wu tɛ̀ nuuŋ mfondɛ tɛ̀ gɛɛ li Jiso-o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Maacho 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Jiso tɛ̀ dza fe, gɛɛŋ kimbɛ ki Tayɛ bɛ Sidɔ-ɔŋ. Le gɛɛŋ le, lɛ li yih, tɛ̀ wɛki yɛ le wi kɛɛ le wɛ lu kɛ. Se nuuŋ le, bɛniiŋ tɛ̀ tuu be kɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Kwɛɛŋ wumu tɛ̀ nuuŋ fe fiana yi tii tɛ̀ nuuŋ li ŋwani wu kwɛɛŋ li. Mfwaa mumkpaŋ si tɛ̀ woo kii Jiso lɛ, se bɛ we li bikaa biee li. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Kwɛɛŋ wulu tɛ̀ nuuŋ wi wu Grik, tɛ̀ nuuŋ yɛ wi wu Juu kɛ. Bɛ tɛ̀ biɛ wu Fonisha li kwɛɛŋ wu Silia. Si tɛ̀ we lɛ, lɛkɛ Jiso le buu ŋwanɛ kiŋkundi wulu li ŋwani wɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Jiso se tuu li wuu le, “Gɛɛ bɛ saa bɛ nyɛkɛ bɔɔŋ, kifɛ fi mɛɛŋ ki dzɔɔŋ kɛ le bɛ dzɔɔ bijinɛ bi bɔɔŋ lɛ bɛ lɔŋ li bwí kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Kwɛɛŋ wulu se tuu li wuu le, “Ɛ chɛɛŋ baa wɛŋ. Se nuuŋ le, bɔɔŋ ti bɛɛ ɛ be ji biee bwí bɔɔnyi mukɛ mu weyi fɛkwiiŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Jiso se tee li wuu le, “Kii fiee fiɔɔ tuu fini, ɔ nuuŋ ɔ gɛɛŋ fio, ŋwanɛ kiŋkundi wulu bee chinɛ li ŋwana kituŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Kwɛɛŋ wulu dza giiŋgi fɛ wu kuuŋ, gɛɛŋ ŋɛŋ ŋwani gimi fɛntaa ɛ ŋwanɛ kiŋkundi wulu bo kituŋ.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso wɔnchɛ kinchiinchii ki wuki biee ki yeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Jiso dza lɛ kimbɛ ki Tayɛ-ɛ, ka Sidɔŋ ka kimbɛ ki Bitoŋ bi Yoofi-i, to dze lɛ Libɛ chi Galilii. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Bɛniiŋ bamu tɛ̀ dza be bɛ bɛ wi wumu nuuŋ kinchiinchii tɛ̀ kii yɛ n'yɔru kɛ. Be lɛkɛ Jiso le gɛɛ tsaŋ yee li wuu bwiŋ, wɔnchɛ wu. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Jiso se dzɔ wu bee wu bo li kintutu linti bebe. Gɛɛ tsaŋ yee li bintooŋ bi wi wulu, kwiyɛ budii, koŋ li nimi chi wi wulu bɛ bu, <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>bichɛ liwe, shɔɔŋ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jiso tɛ̀ shɔɔŋ ni keeti nuuŋ nshiiŋ fɛ wi wulu.</char></note> kweeŋ li wuu le, “Ɛfata,” fi nuuŋ le, “Gwiyɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Bintooŋ bi wi wulu se gwiyɛ mfwaa mumkpaŋ, nimi chee fuutɛ, bɛchi yeti bujɔŋ. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Jiso chiinsɛ li bɛniiŋ li le kiiŋ be ni tee li wi-i kɛ. Se nuuŋ le, si tɛ̀ chiinsini lɛ, tuu to nuuŋ fiee fi be yaki be giiŋgi bɛ fi limfwe limfwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Bimfimu tɛ̀ wondini bɛniiŋ ŋge. Be njanji, be tiiti le, “Jiso kii mfɛru biee bichu bujɔŋ. Feti binchiinchi wuki biee, bibere yeti.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jiso nyɛkɛ bɛniiŋ bɛnchuki bɛnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Maacho 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Nɛɛ li jo yɛɛ, kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ tuu ki bɛ ki turi ni mamama. Fi se nuuŋ le be tɛ̀ kɛmi yɛ fiee fijɛ kɛ, Jiso teeŋ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu tee li bee le, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>“Ŋkɛmɔɔ nshiiŋ fɛ kintutu kini-i, kifɛ be nuuŋ baa tɛɛ be jo taa, fiee fi be nuuŋ be ji se mɛɛŋ yɛ lu kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Ɛ mi nchinɛ le be ni be giiŋgi li bɛla bɛ bee, be gɛɛŋ be kwiyɛ bɛ dzeeŋ lɛ dze, kifɛ bamu li bee linti dza baa mfiiŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu tuu le, “Wi gii dzɔɔ biee bijɛ libuka luni fɛŋ bi nyɛkɛ ŋwaani bani bɛniiŋ lu?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Se bii li bee laa, “Nɛ kɛmi baa tsée yi bibele bi mɛ?” Be tuu le, “Yi yɛɛ mfomɛnyaaŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Jiso se tee li kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ kilu le ki shee yɛ fɛkwiiŋ. Ki shee yɛ, dzɔ tsée yi bibele yi mfomɛnyaaŋ yɛɛ, nyɛ kiyɔɔni li Nyɔ-ɔ, booyɛ, nyɛ li bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u le be gachɛ li be-e. Be gachɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Be tɛ̀ kɛmi tɛ munsuŋu mumu niiŋ kwaa. Se tuu dzɔ tɛ, nyɛ kiyɔɔni li Nyɔ-ɔ, tee le be gachɛ li bɛniiŋ bɛlu-u. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Wi kwi ji fukɛ. Be banchɛ muŋkɛ mu tɛ̀ shɛ, mu yisɛ bɛŋkaa mfomɛnyaaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ ji tɛ̀ nuuŋ si bɛnchuki bɛnɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Se chinɛ be le be ni be kooyi. Lɛ lɛ ŋgo-o mfwaa mumkpaŋ bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u dza be gɛɛŋ bimbe bi Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛfarasii tɛ̀ wɛki le Jiso doonchɛ mfiŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Maacho 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Bɛfarasii dza be bɛ fɛ Jiso-o, be bɛchi bitɛchinɛ bɛ wu, be tee le fɛ fiee fi doonchi buŋga bu dzɛti liboo. Be tɛ̀ tiiti lɛ le be mɔnchɛ wu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Jiso se shɔɔnshɛ ŋge, tee le, “Kiŋgɔkɛ kini wɛki fiee fi doonchi buŋga bu dzɛti liboo le be fɛ la lu? Ntee beŋ chɛɛŋ le kiŋgɔkɛ kini nuuŋ tɛ̀ ŋɛŋ fiee kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Shɛ be, se kaari tuu lɛ lɛ ŋgo-o, lenchi gɛɛŋ liwiŋ lumu lɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso tifi bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u le be ni be dzeti mfi <optbreak/> kii kiŋge ki Bɛfarasii bɛ ki Hɛrɔ-ɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Maacho 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Jiso tɛ̀ giiŋgi lɛ ɛ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u daayɛ le be dzɔɔ kibele, be tɛ̀ kɛmi nɛɛ nuuŋ tsee mumkpaŋ kwaa lɛ ŋgo-o. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Se tuu tifi be tiiti le, “Nɛ dzeti yɛɛŋ, mfi kii kishee ki Bɛfarasii mɔɔ ki Hɛrɔ-ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u bɛchi be yeti be be kii fiee filu, be tiiti le, “Tiitɔɔ kii kishee kini ni kifɛ tɛ mɛɛŋ baa ki kɛmɛ kɛ kibele kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Jiso kɛɛ fiee fi be tiiti kii fi, bii li bee laa, “Nɛ tiiti kii kibele ki nɛ kɛmi yɛ kɛ kii la? Nɛ mɛɛŋ baa ki ŋɛŋ kɛ biee, mɔɔ le nɛ kɛɛ biee kɛ ni? Fi nuuŋ le bufii bunɛ mɛɛŋ bwɛɛ saa ki gwiyɛ kɛ ni? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Nɛ kɛmi lii nɛ tɛ ŋɛŋ biee kɛ ni? Nɛ kɛmi bintooŋ nɛ tɛ woo biee kɛ ni? Nɛ kiimi yɛ biee kɛ ni? <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>Mfi wu ntɛ̀ mbooyɛ tsée yi bibele shiŋ bɛniiŋ bɛnchuki bɛtiinu ji, nɛ tɛ̀ banchɛ biŋkɛ bi tɛ̀ shɛ bi yisɛ bɛŋkaa bɛ mɛ?” Be tuu le, “Yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>Tuu bii li bee laa, “Kii tsée yi mfomɛnyaaŋ yi bɛniiŋ bee be ji bɛnchuki bɛnɛɛ, nɛ bee nɛ banchɛ biŋkɛ bi shɛ bi yisɛ bɛŋkaa bɛ mɛ?” Be tuu le, “Mfomɛnyaaŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Se bii li bee laa, “Nɛ mɛɛŋ baa ki kɛɛ kɛ biee ni?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso gwiyɛ lii yi kinyɛɛ li kitoŋ ki Besaida-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u tɛ̀ lenchi be bo Besaida, bɛniiŋ bamu bɛ bɛ kinyɛɛ kimu lɛ wuu be lɛkɛ le koŋ li ki-i le wɔnchɛ ki. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Jiso kɛmɛ ki li kibɛnɛ-ɛ, dzɔ ki bee ki bo li kitoŋ kilu-u. Kwiyɛ budii li lii yi ki-i, gɛɛ tsaŋ li ki bwiŋ bii li ki-i laa, “Ɔ ŋɛŋgɔɔ biee ni?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Kinyɛɛ kilu tsaaki lii liwe, ki bichɛ ki tee le, “Ŋiŋgɔɔ bɛniiŋ jibi jibi be deŋgi be nuuŋ si biti.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Jiso tuu gɛɛ tsaŋ li lii yi wi wulu-u, mwɛ bichɛ fwiiŋ, lii yee woo, ŋɛŋ biee bichu bujɔŋ. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Jiso se tee li wuu le, “Ɔ giiŋgi fio fɛkuuŋ, si ɔ giiŋgi lɛ kiiŋ ɔ ni tuu ɔ lɛ li kito-oŋ kɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pita tɔ le Jiso nuuŋ Kinsofu ki Nyɔ tɛ̀ kaachɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Maacho 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u dza fe be giiŋgi li bitoŋ bi kimbɛ ki Kasaria Filipi. Le be ni be giiŋgi, se bii li bee laa, “Bɛniiŋ kweŋgi le nuuŋ noo?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Be tuu le, “Bɛniiŋ bamu kweŋgi baa le ɛ wɛ Jɔɔŋ Nlisulidzɔɔ, bamu le Ɛlaja, bamu se kweŋgi le ɔ nuuŋ ntomfɔŋ wu Nyɔ wumu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Se fiiki bii li bee laa, “Nɛ kweŋgi finɛ le nnuuŋ noo?” Pita tuu le, “Ɔ nuuŋ Kinsofu ki Nyɔ tɛ̀ kaachɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Jiso chiinsɛ li bee le kiiŋ be ni mɔŋ be tee fini li wi kii wu kɛ.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso tee kii ŋwaani kwe yi gii kwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Maacho 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Bɛchi tiifi bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u tiiti kii yi yee le, “Ŋwanɛwi kɛmi le ŋɛŋ bumfa ŋge, bɛniiŋ bɛ sɛki kwɛɛŋ bɛ bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ se faaŋ wu. Be gii be wo wu, ke bo jo taa kaari bo li kwe-e.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Tɛ̀ tiiti biee bini li bee ni gbanaa. Pita se dzɔ wu bee wu cheekiyi, bɛchi wami wu li fiee filu-u. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Jiso fiiki yi, bichɛ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u, waŋ Pita tee le, “Dza mi lii Sataŋ! Ɔ lemi yɛ lɛ kimbɛ ki Nyɔ-ɔ kɛ. Ɔ lemɔɔ nuuŋ lɛ ki wiwo-oŋ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Se teeŋ kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ bɛ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u, tee li bee le, “Ɛ wi wɛki le ni biki mi, kɛ kɛmɔɔ le faaŋ yi yee, too kintaaŋ kee se biee mi. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Nɛ kɛɛ le wi wu bachi ntsɛ we kii ni la, kɛ gii nɛɛ lɛɛ wu. Se nuuŋ le, wi wu lɛɛ ntsɛ we kii mi mɔɔ kii ntoŋ wu dzeeŋ kɛ banchɔɔ ntsɛ wulu bu banchɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Ɛ bɛ banchɛ nshɛ yini chichi bɛ nyɛ li wi wu ji, wu tuu wu lɛɛ ntsɛ we, mbeŋ wulu ni nuuŋ la? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Fiee fi wi nuuŋ go fiana yee lu nuuŋ la? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Nɛ kɛɛ le ɛ wi kɛmi buya bu biee yɛ mi mɔɔ jɛ yɛŋ lɛnti lɛ kiŋgɔkɛ ki bifisi biee kini-i kɛ wɛ si wi wu chiiŋgi li nyumi kɛ kwɛsi tuu buti jii bukwɛɛ lɛ kuuŋ, mwɛ kɛɛ le Ŋwanɛwi gii naa kɛmɛ buya bɛ mwɛ tɛ mfi wu kaari wu bɛ lɛ bunɔŋa bu Tee lɛ bɛ bɛnchindaa bɛ Nyɔ bɛ wuuti.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Jiso tuu tee li bee le, “Ntee beŋ chɛɛŋ le, bɛniiŋ bamu lemi baa fɛni bɛ nuuŋ tɛ̀ naa woo kintsi ki kwe-e fuki fɛ be ŋɛŋ bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ si bu bɛɛ bɛ buŋga bu buu nsiŋ kɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mfisɛ yi Jiso fiiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Maacho 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Le jo ka busɔɔ, Jiso dzɔ Pita bee Jeeŋ mɔɔ Jɔɔŋ bee be miri be gɛɛŋ li ŋkumɛ wumu wu ŋgweeŋ li, be gɛɛŋ be nuuŋ fe bebe. Be dza be ŋɛŋ si mfisɛ yi Jiso fiiki lɛ be lii, <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>ndú yee nɛɛŋ, yi miɛŋini yi yɛki si nuuŋ wi tsootsɛ laaŋkwiiŋ yi nɛɛŋ. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Be dza be ŋɛŋ si Ɛlaja bee Mɔɔsɛ busɛ, be yeti bɛ Jiso. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Pita se dza tee li Jiso-o le, “Wi wu ntiifɛ wu nyɔŋa, fi dzɔɔŋ fiɛɛ si tɛ baa fɛni ni. Gɛɛ tɛ gwaŋ bigɔɔnu bitɛɛtu, kimu ni ki nuuŋ ko, kimu ki Mɔɔsɛ, kimu se ni ki nuuŋ ki Ɛlaja-a.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Tɛ̀ tiiti lɛ kifɛ jaaŋ tɛ̀ kɔɔ be ŋge tɛ tuu le kɛɛ fiee fi nuuŋ tee kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Nɛɛ si tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ yeti lɛ, kikuŋ dza ki shee ki baanyɛ be, jɛ se yɔ li kikuŋ kilu linti le, “Wuni nuuŋ Ŋwanɛŋ wu shéŋ. Nɛ wuki yɛɛŋ li wuu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Le be tuu bichi lɔɔ, be ti mɛɛŋ tuu kɛ le be ŋɛŋ bɛniiŋ bɛlu kɛ, be ŋɛŋ nɛɛ nuuŋ Jiso kwaa.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Le be dza li ŋkumɛ wulu-u be beki, Jiso chiinsɛ li bee le kiiŋ be ni tee fiee fi be ŋɛŋ li wi-i fuki fɛ Ŋwanɛwi bo li kwe-e nsiŋ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Be woo lɛ be kiri lɛ be shéŋ, be tɛti maa li yi yi bee laa mbochu li kwe-e wuni nuuŋ la le. <verse eid="MRK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Be se dza be bii li wuu laa, “Ɛ kii la fi bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi kweŋgi le Ɛlaja kɛmi le saa bɛ se Kinsofu ki Nyɔ tɛ̀ kaachɛ se bɛ?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Jiso tuu li bee le, “Fi fiɛɛ chɛɛŋ le Ɛlaja gii naa saa bɛ nachɛ biee bichu bi to si bi tɛ̀ nuuŋ. Se nuuŋ le, ɛ kii la fi bɛ tɛ̀ tsɛɛ le Ŋwanɛwi kɛmi le naa ŋɛŋ bumfa ŋge, bɛniiŋ se faaŋ wu? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Se nuuŋ le, ntee beŋ le Ɛlaja bɛɛɔ kituŋ, bɛniiŋ se fɛ baa fiee fi be kɔŋgisi bɛ wu. Fi fiɛɛ si bɛ tɛ̀ tsɛɛ kii wu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso tɛ buu fiana yi tii li ŋwaŋ wumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Maacho 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luk 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Le Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u bɔɔ be bo fɛ bɔɔŋ bɛ kintutu-u bamu tɛ̀ nuuŋ, ŋɛŋ ɛ kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ ŋge kɛnɛ be, bɛniiŋ bamu bɛ tɛ̀ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ tɛchini biee bee be. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Mfwaa mumkpaŋ, si kintutu kichu tɛ̀ ŋɛŋ Jiso lɛ, ki dzakɛ ŋge, ki letɛ ki gɛɛŋ ki yɛsi wu. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Bii li bee laa, “Nɛ tɛchini biee bɛ be kii la?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Wi tɛ̀ tuu li wuu li kintutu kɛɛ linti le, “Wi wu Ntiifɛ, mbee mbɛ bɛ ŋwanɛŋ fɛ wɛ-ɛ kifɛ fiana yimi yɛɛ li wuu bwiŋ, yi ti feti wi to kibere. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Fiana yilu bɛɛ yi choofi wu yi tundi wu fɛkwiiŋ, bɛfuu buti wu lɛ wa, bɛkini bige, dzɛti nɛchi. Mi nteeɔ le bɔɔŋ bo bɛ kintutu-u buu fiana yilu, be mɔŋ nsiŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Le Jiso woo lɛ, tee li bee le, “E ee! Kiŋgɔkɛ ki mɛɛŋ ki gɛɛ kɛ shéŋ li Nyɔ-ɔ kɛ kini. Ŋgii nuuŋ tɛɛbeŋ ŋgɛɛŋ mbo buŋ? Ŋgii ŋkaŋ shéŋ bɛ beŋ ŋgɛɛŋ mbo buŋ? Bɛ yɛɛŋ bɛ ŋwaŋ wulu fɛni nɛ nyɛ li mi-i.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Be se dzɔ ŋwaŋ wulu be bɛɛ bɛ wu fɛ Jiso-o. Le fiana yilu ŋɛŋ Jiso, yi biee yi chofi ŋwaŋ wulu mfwaa mumkpaŋ we fɛkwiiŋ biŋgisi fe, bɛfuu buti wu lɛwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Jiso bii li te ŋwaŋ wulu-u laa, “Fiee fini tɛ̀ bɛchi mfi wu la?” Tuu le, “Fi tɛ̀ bɛchi fɛ tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ bwi. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Fiana yilu bachɛ yɛɛ wu li kiŋga-a li kiŋga-a fɛ wi-i mɔɔ lidzɔɔ, yi leki le yi wo wu. Ɔɔ nuuŋ ɔ fɛ fiee, nlɛkɔɔ wɛ, ɔ kɔɔ nshiiŋ bɛ bee, ɔ fi bee.” <verse eid="MRK 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Jiso bii li wuu laa, “Le nnuuŋ mfɛ fiee ni? Nuuŋ mfɛ fiee fichu li wi wu gɛɛ shéŋ li mi-i.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Mfwaa mumkpaŋ te ŋwaŋ wulu waŋ lɛwe ŋge le, “Mi ŋgɛɛɔ shéŋ li Nyɔ-ɔ. Fɛrɛ ntuu ŋgɛɛ yaa lɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Le Jiso ŋɛŋ si kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ letini ki bɛɛ ki banchi fɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ, waŋ fiana yi tii yilu, tee le, “Wɛ, fiana yi tii yini yi feti ŋwaŋ wuni tɛ̀ yɔ kɛ tɛ woo biee kɛ, ntiitɔɔ li wɛ-ɛ le, bochɛ li ŋwaŋ wuni-i, ɔ gɛɛŋ. Kiiŋ ɔ ni tuu ɔ lɛ li wuu kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Fiana yilu waŋ lɛwe ŋge, yi ka yi chofi ŋwaŋ wulu, yi toŋ fɛkwiiŋ lɛ dze yi bifi, yi bo li wuu bwiŋ. Giŋ fɛkwiiŋ si gwini chi wi lɛ. Le bɛniiŋ ŋge ŋɛŋ lɛ, be tee le, “Wu kwiɔ kituŋ!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Jiso kɛmɛ wu li kibɛnɛ-ɛ tsaaki wu leŋ we.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Le Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u gɛɛŋ be lɛ li yih, be bii li wuu lɛ jiŋ lɛ jiŋ laa, “Ɛ kii la fi tɛ̀ bee tɛ̀ mɔŋ nsiŋ le tɛ̀ buu ŋwanɛŋ kiŋkundi wulu?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Tuu li bee le, “Fiee fi nuuŋ fi buu ŋwaani wuni nchindaa nuuŋ nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ kwaa. Nuuŋ fiee fimu fi chichi tɛ̀ buu wu kɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso tuu tee kii ŋwaani kwe yi gii kwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Maacho 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Be tɛ̀ dza fe be ka dze yi Galilii, ɛ Jiso tɛ̀ wɛki yɛ le wi kɛɛ kɛ, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>kifɛ tɛ̀ deŋgi tiifi bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u. Tɛ̀ tiifi be le bɛniiŋ gii be nyɛ Ŋwanɛwi li tsaŋ yi bɛniiŋ li be wo wu. Ke bo jo taa, bo li kwe-e. <verse eid="MRK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Le tee lɛ, be ti mɛɛŋ ki kɛɛ kɛ fiee fi tɛ̀ tiiti kɛ, kifɛ be tɛ̀ chɛndi mbifu li wuu.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wi wu nyɔŋa nuuŋ noo?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Maacho 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Be gɛɛŋ be bo Kapanuŋ, le be lɛ be ni be nuuŋ li yih, Jiso bii li bee laa, “Nɛ bee nɛ tɛchini biee lɛ dze kii la?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Be ba nshiiŋ, kifɛ be tɛ̀ deŋgi lɛ dze be tɛchini li yi yi bee laa wi wu limfwe nuuŋ noo le. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Jiso shee fɛkwiiŋ, teeŋ bɛ yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ baa tee li bee le, “Ɛ wi wɛki le ni nuuŋ wi wu limfwe, kɛ kɛmi le dzɔɔ yi yee le wɛ wi wu kinshiiŋgi mɔɔ wi wu nindi li bɛniiŋ bɛchu-u.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Le tee lɛ, dzɔ ŋwaŋ wu bwi leeki lɛ bee lɛnti, tuu dzɔ too wu bɔ tee li bee le, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>“Ɛ wi fi ŋwaŋ si wuni li bukooŋ bwe-eŋ, kɛ wu fiɔ nuuŋ mi. Wi wu fi mi, kɛ mɛɛŋɔ ki fi kɛ nuuŋ mi kwaa kɛ, wu fiɔ nuuŋ wi wu toŋ mi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛ wi baanini yɛ wɛ kɛ, kɛ mwɛ fɛɛfɔɔ wɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Jɔɔŋ tee li wuu le, “Wi wu Ntiifɛ, tɛ̀ bee tɛ̀ ŋɛŋ wumu teenyi bukooŋ bwo se busi bɔɔŋ bɛ kiŋkundi-i li bɛniiŋ li, tɛ̀ loosɛ wu, kifɛ nuuŋ yɛ wi wusɛŋ wu kintutu kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Se nuuŋ le, Jiso tɛ̀ tuu li bee le, “Nɛ loosɛ kɛ ŋwaani wɛɛ wi kɛ. Nɛ kɛɛ le ɛ wi feti mfiŋ teenyi bukooŋ bweŋ, kɛ mwɛ nuuŋ yɛ wi wu nuuŋ tuu ni baanini mi kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Ɛ wi gwii yɛ bɛ bee kɛ, kɛ mwɛ fɛɛfɔɔ bee. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Ntee beŋ chɛɛŋ le, ɛ wi nyɛ mɔɔ nuuŋ fika fi dzɔɔ lɛ li be-eŋ le nɛ woŋ kifɛ bɛ teenyi baa beŋ le bɛniiŋ bɛ Krai lɛ, kɛ nuuŋ mwɛ tɛ̀ naa foo kinderi kee lɛ dzé chichi-i kɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biee bi nuuŋ bi fɛ bɛniiŋ se ni be feti biee bibifi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Maacho 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>Jiso tuu tee le, “Ɛ wi fɛ ŋwaŋ mumkpaŋ li kintutu ki bɔɔŋ bɛ bwi bɛ gɛɛ shéŋ li mi-i bani we li bibifi-i, kɛ fi dzɔɔŋ fiɛɛ le wɛɛ wi-i le bɛ shiiŋɛ jeni chi nɔŋa li kimi kee li, bɛ bachɛ wu li dzɔɔ yi nyɔŋa. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43-44"/>Fi tuu fi nuuŋ le, ɛ kibɛnɛ ko feti le ɔ ni ɔ feti bubiɛɛ, ɔ sondɛ kibɛnɛ kilu. Fi dzɔɔŋ le ɔ lɛ li ntsɛ wu kimakɛ-ɛ bɛ kibɛnɛ kiŋkɔsi, yɛki fɛ ɔ nuuŋ ɔ ni ɔ nuuŋ bɛ bibɛnu bio bichu ɔ tuu ɔ gɛɛŋ fɛ wi wu kimakɛ-ɛ wu duti nyimu nsiŋ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:43-44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biŋwaati bi fichi bimu taa fini bi tuu bi taa tɛ lɛjiŋ lɛ 46 le, “Kintsii kini nuuŋ ki bimuunu jii bɛniiŋ fe, se wi tɛ naa nyiŋ fe kɛ.”</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:43-44"/><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45-46"/>Ɛ kikaa ko feti le ɔ ni ɔ feti bubiɛɛ, ɔ sondɛ kikaa kilu. Fi dzɔɔŋ le ɔ lɛ li ntsɛ wu kimakɛ-ɛ ɔ mɛndi, yɛki le ɔ kɛmɛ bikaa bichu bɛ se lɔŋ wɛ fɛ wi wu kimakɛ-ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:45-46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Ɛ lisi cho feti le ɔ ni ɔ feti bubiɛɛ, ɔ buu lisi chilu. Fi dzɔɔŋ le ɔ lɛ li bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ bɛ lisi chimumkpaŋ, yɛki fɛ ɔ ni kɛmɛ lii chichi, bɛ se lɔŋ wɛ fɛ wi wu nyɔŋa-a. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>Kintsii kini nuuŋ ki bimuunu jii bɛniiŋ fe bi tɛ naa kwi kɛ, wi tɛ̀ naa nyiŋ fe kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>Nɛ kɛɛ le wi gii naa wu mɔŋ wi kwikwi nɛɛ si bɛ ti kusi fiee bɛ ntɔŋ lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>Ntɔŋ ti nuuŋ fiee fi dzeeŋ, fi se fiɛɛ le, ɛ me to n'yikɛ nsiŋ, ɔ gii ɔ geeŋ bɛ me se me kaari me yikɛ? Nɛ nuuŋ yɛɛŋ si ntɔŋ mɛ yiki, wi bee wi se ni be nuuŋ li mbɛɛŋgii li.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Kii ŋkoŋu bɛ kwɛɛŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Maacho 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Jiso se dza fe, gɛɛŋ kimbɛ ki Judiya-a, lenchi Dzɔɔ yi Joodaaŋ gɛɛŋ luwiŋ. Bintutu bi bɛniiŋ lɛ tuu bi banchi bi bɛɛ lɛ wuu, tiifi be nɛɛ si tɛ̀ shiiŋ tiifi. <verse eid="MRK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Bɛfarasii dza be bɛ le be mɔnchɛ wu, be bii li wuu laa, “Nchi beŋ le nuuŋ wi kooŋ bɛ kwɛsi ni?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Jiso kaari bii tɛ li bee laa, “Mɔɔsɛ tɛ̀ nyɛ nchi le nɛ ge la?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Be tuu le, “Mɔɔsɛ tɛ̀ gɛɛ le nuuŋ wi kooŋ bɛ kwɛsi. Ɛ kuŋgi lɔɔ, tsɛɛ kiŋwaati ki doonchi le wu kooŋɔ bɛ wu, nyɛ li wuu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Jiso tuu li bee le, “Tɛ̀ nuuŋ kii bikoo binɛ bi tɛɛmɛ bi Mɔɔsɛ tɛ̀ tsɛɛ nchi wuni li be-eŋ. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Se nuuŋ le, tɛ̀ nuuŋ fɛmbɛɛchɛ-ɛ mfi wu Nyɔ tɛ̀ tɔŋ biee, tɛ tɔŋ nuuŋ nyuŋ bee kwɛɛŋ. Si tɛ̀ tɔŋ lɛ, tee le, <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>‘Ɛ kii fini fi nyuŋ gii shɛ tee bee ni taashɛ bee kwɛsi, <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>be bɛfɛ se to wi mumkpaŋ.’ Nɛɛlɛ, be mɛɛŋ yɛ bɛniiŋ bɛfɛ kɛ, be baa dɛɛni wi mumkpaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Fi se nuuŋ le, fiee fi Nyɔ taashɛ, kiiŋ wi ni mɔŋ ŋgatinɛ kɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Le Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u gɛɛŋ be ni be nuuŋ li yih, be ka be bii li wuu kii fiee filu. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Tuu li bee le, “Mɔɔ nuuŋ noo wu kooŋ bɛ kwɛsi wu dzɔ wumu, kɛ wu fɛɔ bubiɛɛ li kwɛsi-i li ŋgimu bɛ kwɛɛŋ wumu-u. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Ɛ kwɛɛŋ bo li nyumi-i, wu gɛɛŋ wu giŋ bɛ nyuŋ wumu, kɛ wu fɛɔ bubiɛɛ li nyumi-i li ŋgimu bɛ nyuŋ wumu-u.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso tiiŋ mwɛ li bɔɔŋ bɛ bwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Maacho 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Bɛniiŋ tɛ̀ dza be bɛɛ bɛ bɔɔŋ lɛ Jiso-o le koŋ li bee, bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u wami be. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Le Jiso ŋɛŋ lɛ, shéŋ tɔŋ wu, tee li bee le, “Gɛɛ yɛɛŋ bɔɔŋ bɛ bwi ni be bɛɛ lɛ mi-i, nɛ baŋgɛ kɛ be kɛ, kifɛ bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ bwɛɛ nuuŋ li bɛniiŋ si bani-i. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Ntee beŋ chɛɛŋ le, ɛ wi mɛɛŋ ki fi kɛ bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ si ŋwaŋ wu bwi kɛ, mwɛ tɛ naa mɔɔ lɛ lɛ bumfɔŋ bulu-u kɛ”. <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Si tɛ̀ tee lɛ, dzeti be kokini li guu, giki tsaŋ li bee, tiŋi mwɛ li bee.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso bee wi wu kwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Maacho 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Jiso dza le giiŋgɔ, wi wumu letɛ bɛ toŋ núŋ wu lii bii li wuu laa, “Wi wu Ntiifɛ, wɛ wu wi wu dzeeŋ, fiee fi ŋkɛmi le mfɛ nse ŋkɛmɛ ntsɛ wu kimakɛ nuuŋ fi la?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Jiso bii li wu laa, “Ɔ teenyi mi le wi wuu dzeeŋ kii la? Wi nuuŋ yɛ lu wu nuuŋ wi wu dzeeŋ kɛ. Ɛ nɛɛ Nyɔ kwaa yi nuuŋ wi wu dzeeŋ. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Mɔɔ ɔ kiiɔ bɛnchi bɛ nuuŋ le, ‘Kiiŋ ɔ ni wo wi kɛ, kiiŋ ɔ ni giiŋ bɛ kwɛɛ wi kɛ, kiiŋ ɔ ni yi biee kɛ, kiiŋ ɔ ni leŋ lɛ nsa wu binsɛɛ lɛ lɛjiŋ kɛ, kiiŋ ɔ ni fɛ kimfi kɛ, mɔɔ le ɔ ni ɔ guundi chaa bɛ na?’” <verse eid="MRK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Wi wulu tuu li Jiso-o le, “Wi ntiifɛ, bɛnchi bani bɛchu ntɛ mbɛchi ŋkichi be mɛɛŋ sɔɔnɛwi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Jiso bichɛ wu ni fwiiŋ, kɔɔŋgi wu, tee li wuu le, “Fiee shɛ fiɛɛ fimumkpaŋ fi ɔ mɛɛŋɔ ɔ fɛ. Gɛnɛ ɔ kabɛ biee bi ɔ kɛmi bichu, ɔ gachɛ kwa wulu li bɛniiŋ bɛ kifoo lɛ, ɔ se kɛmɛ bulofu nuuŋ liboo. Ɔɔ fɛ lɛ, ɔ se bɛ ɔ ni ɔ biki mi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Le Jiso tee lɛ, wi wulu woo, soo bilii, fiiki yi yee dza giiŋgi nshiiŋ nshiiŋ, kifɛ tɛ̀ kɛmi kwa ŋge.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Jiso dza fiiki yi bichɛ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u, tee li bee le, “Fi gii fi tɛmi ŋge le bɛniiŋ bɛ kwa lɛ li bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>N'yɔru wulu fieeŋgi bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u. Jiso tuu tee li bee le, “Bɔɔŋ beŋ, fi tɛɛmi ŋge fɛ wi-i<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biŋwaati bi fichi bimu kɛmi fɛni le, “Li wi wu gɛɛ bufii li kwa…”</char></note> le lɛ li bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Fi fiɛɛ tsɛkɛ fɛ kikuŋ nuuŋ ki lɛ lɛ fiooŋ yi nsara-a yɛki fɛ wi wu kwa nuuŋ lɛ li bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Be woo lɛ fi se fieeŋgi be ŋge, be tuu be njanjɛ be tee le, “Ɛ fi nuuŋ lɛ, noo se naa bo lu?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Jiso kaari bichɛ be, tee le, “Fini nuuŋ fi yaa wiwoŋ, se nuuŋ le fi tɛ̀ nyɛ tɛ yaa Nyɔ kɛ, kifɛ Nyɔ nuuŋ yi fɛ fiee fichu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Pita se dza tee li Jiso-o le, “Bichɛ ɔ ŋɛŋ, tɛ chinɛ baa biee bichu tɛ tuu tɛ biki wɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Jiso tuu li wuu le, “Ntee wɛ chɛɛŋ le, wi nuuŋ yɛ lu wu chinɛ yih ye, kɛ bɛŋwaani, kɛ dzɛ́mi yee, kɛ ni, kɛ tee, kɛ bɔɔŋ bee, kɛ yɛ́h yee, le wu chinɔɔ kii mi mɔɔ ntoŋ wu dzeeŋ wu kii Nyɔ, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>wu nuuŋ tɛ nuuŋ le kɛmɛ yih mɔɔ bɛŋwaani, mɔɔ dzɛmi, mɔɔ bɛni, mɔɔ bɔɔŋ, mɔɔ yɛ́h li ntsɛ wu dɛɛni foo ŋkɛmɛ kiŋga gwii siŋ kɛ. Bɛniiŋ gii be tuu be ni be biindi tɛ bikaa lɛ wuu jiŋ, ke tuu nuuŋ li mfi wu ntsɛ wu bɛɛ li, nɛ kɛmɛ ntsɛ wu kimakɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Se nuuŋ le, bɛniiŋ ŋge bɛ nuuŋ limfwe dɛɛni gii be nuuŋ lɛjiŋ, bɛ ŋge bɛ nuuŋ lɛjiŋ dɛɛni to limfwe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso tuu tee kiŋga kitɛɛtɛ kii kwe ye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Maacho 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u dza be dzɔ dze, be yɛki Jɛrosalɛŋ tuuti mbaaŋ. Bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u tɛti maa. Bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ biki wu, tɛ̀ kɛmi chɛnɛ. Jiso tuu dzɔ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u bɛ yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ baa bee be cheekiyi se tuu tiiti be fiee fi gii fi ka bɛ wu. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>Tee li bee le, “Yikɛ yɛɛŋ nɛ woo, tɛ yɛki baa tɛ giiŋgi Jɛrosalɛŋ bɛ giiŋgi baa bɛ nyɛ Ŋwanɛwi li tsaŋ yi bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ, be saa wu be sondɛ le be wo wu, be nyɛ wu li tsaŋ yi bito-oŋ, <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>be ni be choosi wu, be kwiyi wu bɛ budii, be ni be tuki wu, be se wo wu, ke bo jo taa, bo li kwe-e.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jeeŋ bee Jɔɔŋ lɛkɛ bintindu bi nɔŋa bi nɔŋa li Jiso-o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Maacho 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Jeeŋ bee Jɔɔŋ bɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ bɔɔŋ bɛ Dzɛbɛdii dza be kiŋgi be bɛ Jiso limfwe be tee li wuu le, “Wi wu Ntiifɛ, fiee fiɛɛ lu fi tɛ wɛki le ɔ fɛ li bee li.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Jiso bii li bee laa, “Nɛ wɛki le mfɛ la li be-eŋ?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Be tuu le, “Tɛ wɛki baa le ke mfi wuɔ shee li kabara wu bunɔŋa bwo-o, tɛ shee li bintindu-u bi nɔŋa bi nɔŋa, wi wumu lɛ kibɛnɛ ko ki kigɔŋɛ-ɛ, wumu lɛ kibɛnɛ ki kimɛsɛ-ɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Se nuuŋ le, Jiso tɛ̀ tuu li bee le, “Nɛ kii yɛ fiee fi nɛ biiti kɛ. Nuuŋ nɛ woŋ fika fi ŋgɛ-ɛ fi ŋgii ŋ'woŋ, kɛ nɛ lɛ li ŋwaani ŋgɛ wu nyɔŋa wu ŋgii nlɛ wuni ni?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Be tuu li wuu le, “Tɛ nuuŋ tɛ fɛ.” Jiso tee li bee le, “Nuuŋ nɛ woŋ fika fi ŋgɛ-ɛ fi ŋgii ŋ'woŋ, kɛ nɛ lɛ tɛ ŋwaani ŋgɛ wu nyɔŋa wu ŋgii lɛ lu wuni. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Se nuuŋ le li nshewu lɛ kibɛnɛ keŋ ki kigɔŋɛ-ɛ kɛ lɛ ki kimɛsɛ-ɛ nuuŋ yɛ kintsii keŋ le nyɛ li wi-i kɛ. Bintsii bilu biɛɛ li bɛniiŋ bɛ bɛ nachɛ li bee.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Le kiŋkɛ ki bɔɔŋ bɛ kintutu-u bɛ Jiso bɛ yoofi baa tuu be woo kii fiee filu shéŋ tɔŋ be bɛ Jeeŋ bee Jɔɔŋ. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Jiso se teeŋ be bɛchu be bɛ, tee li bee le, “Mɔɔ nɛ kii baa le bɛniiŋ bɛ sɛki tɛɛŋ yimi ti shiiti li bɛniiŋ bɛbee bɛ bito-oŋ, bɛniiŋ bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa bɛbee doonchi buŋga lɛ bee lɛwe ni? <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Fiɛɛ kɛmi yɛ le fi ni fi nuuŋ li be-eŋ linti kɛ. Wi wu wɛki le ni nuuŋ wi wu nyɔŋa lɛ be-eŋ lɛnti kɛmi le ni nuuŋ wi nindi li be-eŋ bu nimu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>Wi wu wɛki le ni nuuŋ wi wu limfwe li be-eŋ linti, kɛ kɛmɔɔ le ni nuuŋ mfwa wu wi kwikwi. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Nɛ kɛɛ le Ŋwanɛwi ti mɛɛŋ ki bɛ kɛ le bɛniiŋ ni be nindi li wuu kɛ. Tɛ̀ bɛ nuuŋ le niŋ li bɛniiŋ li, nyɛ ntsɛ we soo bɛniiŋ ŋge li tsaŋ yi kwe-e.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso gwiyɛ lii yi Batimayu wu tɛ̀ nyɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Maacho 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Be dɛndɛ be bɛ be bo li kitoŋ ki Jɛriko-o. Le Jiso ni tuu dzɛti fe, bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu mɔɔ kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ ki nɔŋa, be ŋɛŋ kinyɛɛ kimu ɛ ki shee li ŋgemɛ yi dze-e ki lɛki biee bukooŋ le Batimayu, ŋwanɛ Timayu. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Le woo le ɛ Jiso wu Nasarɛ, bɛchi dzɛŋgi le, “Jiso, Ŋwanɛ kini ki Mfɔŋ Daafi, kɔɔ nshiiŋ bɛ mi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Bɛniiŋ ŋge dza be bɛchi be wami wu, be tiiti le makɛ. Se nuuŋ le, tɛ̀ tuu mɛɛshi dzaaŋ le, “Ŋwanɛ kini ki Mfɔŋ Daafi, kɔɔ nshiiŋ bɛ mi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Jiso leŋ, tee le be teeŋ wu. Be se teeŋ kinyɛɛ kilu be tee le, “Kɛmɛ shéŋ, dza we, teenyɔɔ wɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Kinyɛɛ kilu lɔŋ ndu ye fɛkwiiŋ, ki jiŋ liwe ki gɛɛŋ fɛ Jiso-o. <verse eid="MRK 10:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Jiso bii li ki-i laa, “Ɔ wɛki le mfɛ la li wɛ?” Se kinyɛɛ kilu tuu le, “Wi Ntiifɛ, ŋ'wɛkɔɔ le ŋɛŋ biee.” <verse eid="MRK 10:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Jiso se tee li ki-i le, “Ɔ giiŋgi fio. Shéŋ yi ɔ gɛɛ li mi-i fɛ yɛɛ ɔ tɛmi.” Mfwaa mumkpaŋ, lii yi ki woo, ki tuu ki ŋɛŋ biee, ki dza ki biki Jiso fɛ tɛ̀ giiŋgi.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Bɛ fi Jiso Jɛrosalɛŋ si Mfɔŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Maacho 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jɔɔŋ 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Le Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u ni be fɛɛshi Jɛrosalɛŋ fɛ be tɛ̀ nuuŋ li bintsii bi Bɛtfaj lichiŋ bɛ bi Bɛtani bi nuuŋ lichiŋ li Ŋkumɛ wu Biti bi Oli-if, buu bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u bɛfɛ toŋ, <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>tee li bee le, “Gɛnɛ yɛɛŋ li kintsii ki nuuŋ limfwe kii yɛ, si nɛ gii nɛ ni nɛ lii fe ni, mfwaa mumkpaŋ, nɛ gii nɛ ŋɛŋ ŋwanɛ sɔmbwaa ɛ bɛ kaŋ, wi mɛɛŋɔɔ saa kɛ le beŋ li wuu liwe kɛ, nɛ fanchɛ nɛ bɛ bɛ wu. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Ɛ wi bii li be-eŋ laa nɛ fanchi kii la le, nɛ tuu le Te Kikoo kɛmɔɔ fiee fi fɛrɛ bɛ wu, gii kaari tuu wu lijiŋ dɛɛŋ dɛɛŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Be se dza be gɛɛŋ be ŋɛŋ ŋwanɛ sɔmbwaa wulu ɛ bɛ kaŋ wu fɛ fweeŋ wu yih yimi lɛ dze. Be se fanchɛ wu. <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Si be tɛ̀ fanchi lɛ bɛniiŋ bamu bɛ tɛ̀ lemi fe bii li bee laa, “Nɛ fanchi ŋwanɛ sɔmbwaa wɛɛ kii la?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Be se tee li bee fiee fi Jiso bee tee. Be chinɛ li bee be gɛɛŋ bɛ wu. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Be bɛ bɛ wu fɛ Jiso-o, be deeri ndú yi be li sɔmbwaa wulu-u liwe, Jiso beŋ li wuu. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Bɛniiŋ ŋge tɛ̀ gikisi ndú lɛ dze, bamu bonyi yɛ́ŋɛ yi biti libuka be gikisi tɛ̀ lɛ dze. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ giiŋgi Jiso limfwe mɔɔ bɛ tɛ̀ biki lɛjiŋ tɛ̀ wuuyi le, “Yiyi-i, yiyi-i, yiyi-i, kiyɔɔni nuuŋ li Nyɔ-ɔ looo! Nyɔ tiiŋ yɛ mwɛ li wi wu bɛɛ li bukooŋ bu Taa lɛ looo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ'wuuyɛ wuni nuuŋ lɛ jɛ́ yi Grik le, Hoshana</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Nyɔ tiiŋ yɛ mwɛ li bumfɔŋ bu taa wusɛŋ wu Daafi-i bu bɛɛ li looo, mpiaru nuuŋ li Nyɔ-ɔ yi liboo li looo, yiyi-i, yiyi-i, yiyi-i!” <verse eid="MRK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Jiso se gɛɛŋ fɛsi Jɛrosalɛŋ lɛ li yih yi muntofi, bichɛ ŋɛŋ si biee bichuchu nuuŋ. Le mɛrisi lɔɔ nuuŋ si mfi tɛ̀ ka lɛ, bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u bɛ yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ baa dza be gɛɛŋ Bɛtani.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso tsoŋ kiti kimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Maacho 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Butuu bo bu woo Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u dza Bɛtani be tuu be giiŋgi Jɛrosalɛŋ dzeeŋ tɛ̀ wuu wu. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Lɔŋ lii ŋɛŋ kiti kimu limfwe mfiiŋ ki bɛ ti shiiŋ bɛ jii, ki bɔchi bɛ bibɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kiti kini nuuŋ ki bɛ teenyi lɛ jɛ́ yi bala le, “fig”.</char></note> Se dza giiŋgi fe le ŋɛŋ laa nuuŋ nɛɛ kɔ fiee li ki-i jii le. Le gɛɛŋ bo fe ti mɛɛŋ ki ŋɛŋ kɛ fiee li kii kɛ, ŋɛŋ nuuŋ bibɛ kwaa, kifɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ yɛ mfi wu ki ti wundi kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Se tee li kiti kilu le, “Kiiŋ wi ni naa tuu ka ji fiee li wɛ-ɛ kɛ.” Si tɛ̀ tee lɛ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u woo.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso kooŋ bɛniiŋ bɛ waaŋ li yih yi muntofi yi Nyɔ-ɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Maacho 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jɔɔŋ 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Be dza be gɛɛŋ be fɛsi Jɛrosalɛŋ Jiso se gɛɛŋ lɛ li yih yi muntofi-i bɛchi kuŋgi bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ feti waŋ fe. Tɛ̀ kuŋgi lɛ bachi mɔɔ bidaŋ bi bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ fikisi kwa-a, mɔɔ bintindu bi bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ kabini bibimu-u. <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>Tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ tuu kɛ le beŋ le, wi too fiee dansɛ bɛ fi li yih yi muntofi kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Se tɛ̀ tiifi be tiiti le, “Mɔɔ bɛ tɛ̀ tsɛɛ Nyɔ tiiti le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">‘Yih ye bɛ gii bɛ ni bɛ teenyi le yih yi nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ li tɛɛŋ chichi-i?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:17">Se nuuŋ le, nɛ fiiki baa yih yi to ntuuŋ wu bɛyi.” <verse eid="MRK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Le bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ tiifi bɛnchi woo lɛ be se tuu be wɛki dze yibe gii be wo wu le. Be tɛ̀ kɛmi chɛnɛ li ŋ'wo wuu kifɛ kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ kɛɛ kichu tɛ̀ wuki ntiifɛ we bimfimu wondini be. <verse eid="MRK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Le tuu ni nuuŋ lɛ fɛmfo-o, Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u bo li kitoŋ kilu-u.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ntiifɛ wu dzɛti li kiti ki Jiso tɛ̀ tso-oŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Maacho 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u bo be kɛti fɛŋwɛɛ, be ŋɛŋ kiti kɛɛ ɛ ki wɔɔbɛ kichu ki shee ki bo li gɛɛŋ li. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Pita kimi fiee fi tuu fi ka, kweeŋ li Jiso-o le, “Wi wu Ntiifɛ, ŋɛŋ si kiti ki ɔ tuu ɔ tsoŋ kɛɛ si ki wɔɔbɛ kituŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Jiso se tee li be bɛchu-u le, “Gɛɛ yɛɛŋ shéŋ li Nyɔ-ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Ntee beŋ chɛɛŋ le, ɛ wi tee li ŋkumɛ wuni-i le, ‘Mubɛ fɛni ɔ gɛɛŋ ɔ we li dzɔɔ yi nyɔŋa’, ɛ tiiti lɛ mɛŋini yɛ li shéŋ yee li kɛ, nuuŋ ɛ wu beŋ le fiee fi tiiti nuuŋ fi ji, wu mubɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Bɛdɛɛni, ntee beŋ chɛɛŋ le, fiee fichu fi nɛ lɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ, ɛ nɛ beŋ le nɛ kɛmɛ baa kituŋ, kɛ nɛ gii nɛ kɛmɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Ɛ nɛ leŋ le nɛ lɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ, ɛ nuuŋ le wumu kɛmi wumu lɛ shéŋ, feeki wu. Nɛ feti lɛ kifɛ Baa wunɛ wu nuuŋ liboo gii ni fekisi tɛ bibifi binɛ. [<verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>Ɛ nɛ mɛɛŋ ki feeki kɛ bibifi bi bɛniiŋ bamu-u kɛ, Baa wunɛ wu nuuŋ liboo nuuŋ tɛ dzɛŋ le ni fekisi tɛ binɛ kɛ.]”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se nuuŋ le biŋwaati bi fichi bimu bi bɛ tɛ̀ saa tsɛɛ jɛ Nyɔ fe kɛmiyɛ kiŋkɛ kini kɛ.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Be bii fɛ buŋga bu Jiso-o bo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Maacho 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u tɛ̀ tuu be bɛ be lɛ Jɛrosalɛŋ. Le ni tuu deŋgi fɛ yih yi muntofi, bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bɛ sɛki kwɛɛŋ dza be bɛ be ŋɛŋ wu, <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>be bii li wuu laa, “Ɔ dzɔ buŋga fɛŋ bu ɔ feti biee bini? Ɛ noo wu nyɛ wɛ buŋga bulu le ɔ ni ɔ feti biee bini?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Jiso tee li bee le, “Ŋgii mbii fiee li be-eŋ fimumkpaŋ, nɛ tuu mi, nse ntuu ntee beŋ wi wu nyɛ buŋga le ni mfeti biee bini. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Ɛ noo wu tɛ̀ nyɛ Jɔɔŋ buŋga se lisi bɛniiŋ li dzɔɔ? Ɛ Nyɔ mɔɔ wi wu laaŋ we le? Tee yɛɛŋ mi ŋ'woo!” <verse eid="MRK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Be se bɛchi be tɛchini li yi yi bee le, “Ɛ tɛ tuu le ɛ Nyɔ, se bii li bee li laa, ɛ la fi tɛ̀ fɛ, se tɛ mɛɛŋ ki beŋ kɛ li Jɔɔŋ li kɛ? <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Ɛ nuuŋ le tɛ tuu le ɛ wiwoŋ wu nyɛ, nuuŋ fi ji ni?” Be tɛ̀ chɛndi bɛniiŋ kifɛ bɛniiŋ bɛchu tɛ̀ beŋ le Jɔɔŋ tɛ̀ gbɛŋgi nuuŋ ntomfɔŋ wu Nyɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Bɛdɛɛni, be se tuu li Jiso le, “Tɛ kii yɛ kɛ.” Jiso se tuu tee li bee le, “Kɛ nuuŋ ntɛ̀ ntee tɛ beŋ wi wu nyɛ mi buŋga le ni mfeti biee bini kɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ŋgaŋgaa kii bɛniiŋ bɛ wi tɛ̀ gɛɛ li wɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Maacho 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Jiso se dza bɛchi yeti li bee lɛ ŋgaŋgaa li le, “Wi wumu tɛ̀ niŋ wɛ wu muntaaŋ mu bɛ feti mbiiŋ lu, toŋ mbaŋ kɛnɛ, se chiŋ kisɔ ki bɛ gii bɛ ni bɛ seendi muntaaŋ mulu le mbiiŋ buti, gwaŋ kikɔ li wi wu kiichi wɛ wulu, gɛɛ bɛniiŋ li wɛ wulu-u, se dza gɛɛŋ li kitoŋ kimu-u. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Le mfi wu bɛ ti kee mu bɛ wu kɔchɛ, toŋ ŋwani wu nimɛ wumu lɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ gɛɛ wɛ li bee baa le be nyɛ wu mwee muntaaŋ le be bɛ mu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Le gɛɛŋ, be tuu be kɔɔ wu be too wu, be kooŋ bɛ wu, to lijiŋ bɔ kilɛrɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Wi wu wɛ wulu se tuu ka toŋ ŋwani wu nimɛ wumu, le gɛɛŋ, be ka be too wu be tɔ wu kikoo, be chɔɔri wu. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Se tuu ka toŋ wumu, be wo wu buwo. Se tuu nɛɛ toŋ bamu ŋge mumkpaŋ mumkpaŋ, be too bamu, be woyɛ bamu. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Toŋ nsiiŋ bɛ shɛ nuuŋ ŋwaŋ mumkpaŋ, wuni se nuuŋ ŋwani nuuŋ shéŋ yee tɛ̀ mɛɛshi toŋ wu lɛ bee, beechi le be gii be gɛɛŋ be guuŋ kwiiŋ li ŋwani wulu-u. <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Le gɛɛŋ, bɛniiŋ bɛlu tuu be tee li yi yi bee le, ‘Wuni wɛ kinjila ki wi wu wɛ wuni-i, bɛ yɛɛŋ tɛ wo wu, bishɛyɛ bilu se ni bi nuuŋ bisɛŋ.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Be se kɔɔ wu, be wo wu, be buu wu be lɔŋ wu lɛ mba-aŋ lɛkuuŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>Le Jiso tee lɛ, se bii laa, “Fiee fi wi wu wɛ wuni nuuŋ fɛ, nuuŋ la? Gii bɛ lɛɛshɛ bɛ bɛniiŋ balu bu lɛɛshɛ, gɛɛ nuuŋ bɛniiŋ bɛ detɛ li wɛ wulu-u. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Nɛ mɛɛŋ baa ki teeŋ kɛ kintsii kini lɛ Kiŋwaati ki Nyɔ-ɔ ni? Bɛ tsɛɛ le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Tɛtɛ chi bɛniiŋ bɛ ŋgwanu tɛ̀ faaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">tɛ̀ tuu chi dza chi to tɛtɛ chi boo chi yi-i.<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Fini nuuŋ mfɛru wu Taa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">bɛniiŋ se bichi be tii wa.’”<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Bɛniiŋ baa woo ŋgaŋgaa chini, be se kɛɛ le Jiso waɔ nuuŋ li bee. Be se wɛki le be kɔɔ wu, be chɛndi nuuŋ kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ ki tɛ̀ nuuŋ fe. Be se chinɛ li wuu, be dza be giiŋgi.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛ terɛ Jiso kii kiŋwaati ki sofɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Maacho 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Bikoo bi kwɛɛŋ lɛ dza bi toŋ Bɛfarasii mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bamu bɛ kintutu ki Mfɔŋ Hɛrɔ le be gɛɛŋ be terɛ Jiso be kɔɔ wu li n'yɔru we-e. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Be bɛ be tee li Jiso-o le, “Wi wu ntiifɛ, tɛ ti kii le ɔ shiiŋ ɔ tiiti nuuŋ chɛɛŋ, kifɛ ɔ chɛndi yɛ wi lii kɛ, mɔɔ mwɛ nuuŋ noo le. Ɔ tiifi chɛɛŋ lɛ dze yi Nyɔ-ɔ. Tee bee laa nchi beenchi le bɛ ni bɛ suuti kiŋwaati li Kaisa wu nuuŋ Mfɔŋ wu nyɔŋa wu Lom, mɔɔ wu mɛɛŋ ki beŋ kɛ le? <verse eid="MRK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Tɛ ni tɛ suuti, mɔɔ tɛ soo kɛ le?” Jiso kɛɛ fiee fi be gii be kanyi bɛ fi, tuu li bee le, “Nɛ teeki mi kii la? Bɛ yɛɛŋ bɛ lisi chi kwa-a ŋɛŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Be se bɛ bɛ chi, fi, bii laa, “Kikoo kini bɛ bukooŋ buni nuuŋ bu noo lɛ?” Be tuu le, “Ɛ ki Kaisa, bukooŋ se nuuŋ nɛɛ bwee.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Jiso se tee li bee le, “Nɛ nyɛɛ fiee fi nuuŋ fi Kaisa li wuu, nɛ nyɛɛ fi Nyɔ li Nyɔ-ɔ.” Le be woo lɛ, yi kwi be.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛ terɛ Jiso kii ntaashɛ wu kwɛɛŋ <optbreak/> bee nyuŋ mfi wu be bo li kwe-e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Maacho 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Bɛsadusii bamu tɛ̀ dza be bɛ le be bii fiee li Jiso-o. Bɛsadusii tɛ̀ nuuŋ bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ kweŋgi le nuuŋ bɛniiŋ tɛ̀ bo li kwe-e kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>Le be bɛ lɛ, be tee le, “Wi wu ntiifɛ, Mɔɔsɛ tɛ̀ tsɛɛ li bee li lɛ bɛnchi-i le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:19">‘Ɛ ŋwaani wi kwi wu shɛ kwɛɛŋ ŋwaŋ nsiŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:19">kɛ wi wulu kɛmi le dzɔɔ kwɛɛ ŋku wulu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:19">bee wu biɛ bɔɔŋ li bukooŋ bu ŋku ŋwaani-i.’<verse eid="MRK 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Bɛdɛɛni, wi wumu tɛ̀ kɛmi bɔɔŋ bɛ buniŋ mfomɛnyaaŋ, wu kaaŋ tɛ̀ dzɔ kwɛɛŋ, kwi bee wu mbiɛ ŋwaŋ nsiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Wu biki se dzɔ tɛ̀ kwɛɛŋ wulu, kwi tɛ̀ ŋwaŋ nsiŋ. Fi ka nɛɛ tɛ lɛ bɛ wu biki li wuu wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Be bɛchu dzɔ wu, wi se tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ ki nuuŋ kɛ li bɛniiŋ bɛ mfomɛnyaaŋ bɛlu-u lɛnti wu tɛ̀ biɛ ŋwaŋ bɛ kwɛɛŋ wulu kɛ. Lɛjiŋ lɛlu kwɛɛŋ wulu tɛ̀ kwi tɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Si bɛniiŋ bɛ mfomɛnyaaŋ bani tɛ̀ dzɔ kwɛɛŋ wulu be bɛchu lɛ, gii ni nuuŋ mfi wu bɛniiŋ buti li kwe-e, kwɛɛŋ wulu se nuuŋ kwɛɛ noo?” <verse eid="MRK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Jiso tee li bee le, “Nɛ kii baa fiee fi feti nɛ se tɛndi dzé ni? Fi fiɛɛ lɛ kifɛ nɛ kii yɛ fiee fi bɛ tsɛɛ lɛ Kiŋwaati ki Nyɔ-ɔ kɛ, nɛ kii yɛ tɛ mɔɔ buŋga bu Nyɔ-ɔ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Fiee fi nuuŋ lu fiɛɛ le mfi wu bɛniiŋ buti li kwe-e, buniŋ bee bukɛɛŋ mɛɛŋ yɛ le be ni be feti bugoo kɛ, bɛniiŋ mɛɛŋ yɛ be tuu be ni be nyɛɛ bɔɔŋ li bugoo li kɛ. Be gii naa be ni be nuuŋ nɛɛ si bɛnchindaa bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ liboo. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Kii fiee fi mbochu li kwe-e, nɛ mɛɛŋ baa ki teeŋ kɛ kintsii lɛ Kiŋwaati ki Mɔɔsɛ-ɛ kii kiti ki tɛ̀ duti Nyɔ yeti li Mɔɔsɛ yi tiiti le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:26">‘Ɛ mi Nyɔ yi Abrahaŋ bɛ Nyɔ yi Adzi mɔɔ Nyɔ yi Yakɔ ni?’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abrahaŋ, Adzi bɛ Yakɔ tɛ̀ nuuŋ nuuŋ bɛte taa bɛ Bɛjuu lɛ</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Fi nuuŋ le Nyɔ nuuŋ yɛ Nyɔ yi biŋkwi kɛ, yi nuuŋ nuuŋ Nyɔ yi bɛniiŋ bɛ yoŋ. Nɛ chaŋ baa biee ŋge.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nchi wu yɛki bɛnchi bɛchu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Maacho 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Wi wumu wu tɛ̀ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ bɛ, woo si Jiso bee bɛniiŋ baa tɛchini biee, tuu ŋɛŋ si wu tuu fiee fi be bii li wuu lɛ dze yi dzeeŋ li, bii tɛ li Jiso laa, “Nchi wu yɛki bɛnchi bɛchu nuuŋ wu la?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Jiso tuu li wuu le, “Nchi wu yɛki bɛnchi bɛchu nuuŋ wuni wu tiiti le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:29">‘Hooo bɛniiŋ bɛ Isɛlɛɛ woo yɛɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:29">Taa Nyɔ, wu Nyɔ yisɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:29">Taa Nyɔ wulu nuuŋ nɛɛ mumkpaŋ.<verse eid="MRK 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Ɔ kɔŋgisi Taa wu Nyɔ ya bɛ shéŋ ya chi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:30">ɔ nyɛɛ kikoo ko li yi-i kichu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:30">ɔ gɛɛ bufii bwo li yi-i buchu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:30">ɔ nindi li yi-i bɛ buŋga bwo buchu.’<verse eid="MRK 12:30"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Nchi wu biki li wuni se nuuŋ le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:31">‘Ɔ kɔŋgisi ŋwaana siɔ kɔŋgisi yi ya.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 12:31">Nchi wumu nuuŋ yɛ lu wu yɛki bani kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Wi wu tɛ̀ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ wɛ se tee li Jiso-o le, “Wi wu Ntiifɛ, ɔ tuuɔ nɛɛ bujɔŋ. Ɔ tiitɔɔ nuuŋ chɛɛŋ le Nyɔ nuuŋ nɛɛ mumkpaŋ yimi nuuŋ yɛ lu fuki yi nsiŋ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Ŋkɔŋgisɛ yi bɛ shéŋ chi, ŋgɛwu bufii li yi-i buchu, nimu li yi-i bɛ buŋga buchu bɛ ŋkɔŋgisɛ ŋwaana siɔ kɔŋgisi yi ya, tuuɔ wu yaa mɔɔ mfɛru muntofi bɛ nyáŋ yi tɔnyɛ mɔɔ bɛntaanchɛ bamu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Le Jiso tuu ŋɛŋ si wu tuu si wi bufii, se tuu tee li wuu le, “Ɔ nuuŋ yɛ mfiiŋ li nlɛ li bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ kɛ.” Lɛjiŋ lɛlu, wi se tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ ki tuu kɛ le mɔŋ mbɛ le bii fiee li wuu kɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kinsofu ki Nyɔ tɛ̀ kaachɛ nuuŋ ŋwanɛ noo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Maacho 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Jiso bɛ tiifi bɛniiŋ li yih yi muntofi-i, dza bii li bee laa, “Bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi geeŋ be se tiiti le Kinsofu ki Nyɔ tɛ̀ kaachɛ nuuŋ ŋwanɛ Mfɔŋ Daafi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Nuuŋ ɛ Fiana yi Waaŋ tɛ̀ saa yi fɛ se Mfɔŋ Daafi wuni kweeŋ kii Kinsofu kilu tiiti le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Taa Nyɔ tɛ̀ tee li Taa li le</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">shee lɛ kibɛnɛ kee ki kigɔŋɛ-ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">nsiiŋ fɛ yi giiki bɛniiŋ bee bɛ mbani-i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">wu tɔmi bikaa biee li bee’.<verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>Ɛ Daafi kibɛɛ teenyi wu le Taa we, fi geeŋ se tuu ni nuuŋ ŋwani?” Si Jiso tɛ̀ tiiti biee bini lɛ, kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ ŋge ki tɛ̀ nuuŋ fe tɛ̀ wuki kinɛɛtinɛ wuu be.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso tɔchɛ biŋge bi bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Maacho 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Le tuu ni tiifi bɛniiŋ dza tee li bee le, “Dzɔɔ yɛɛŋ mfi, bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ. Be ti kɔŋgisi nchuminɛ ndú yi nyɔŋa yi nyɔŋa be deŋgi li bintsii bi bɛ kabini biee li le bɛniiŋ ni be yɛɛshi be bɛ kin'yokisɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>Fɛ be gɛɛŋ li yih yi nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ, kɛ fɛ tsɔnɔ-ɔ, be tsaa nɛɛ nuuŋ bintindu bi nɔŋa bi nɔŋa, be se shee li bi-i liwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Ɛ nɛɛ be bɛ tusi bukɛɛŋ bɛɛŋku-u lijiŋ, be yɛŋgi be fii biee bi bee, be tuu be feti nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ wu deendi le be ni be doonchi yi. Ŋwaani bani bɛniiŋ, wu be wu ŋgɛ gii naa bee ŋge.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nya yi kwɛɛ ŋku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Jiso dza gɛɛŋ lɛ shee limfwe li fiŋko fi nya-a fi li yih yi muntofi-i, se bichi si bɛniiŋ bɛɛ be giki kwa lɛ fiŋko filu-u. Bɛniiŋ bɛ kwaa se tɛ̀ bɛɛ ŋge be giki kwa le ŋgɔɔkwe-e wu. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Kwɛɛŋku wumu se dza bɛ, nuuŋ wi wu kifoo, gɛɛ munini le mumfɛɛŋ mu feti lisi chi kwa-a chi mumkpaŋ, wu mɛɛŋ ki bo kɛ fiee kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Jiso se teeŋ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u tee li bee le, “Ntee li be-eŋ chɛɛŋ le kwɛɛ ŋku wuni wu nuuŋ wi wu kifoo, nyɛɔ wu yaa bɛniiŋ bɛchu bɛ gɛɛ fiee lɛ fiŋko fi li yih yi muntofi fini. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Bɛniiŋ bɛchu bɛ be be nyɛɛ, be be bɛɛ nuuŋ bɛ tsuu yi kwa wu be wu yisɛ wu shooshi. Se nuuŋ le, bee bɛ bɛ kifoo kee kichu wu nyɛ fiee fichu fi be kɛmi, nuuŋ fi fi bee nuuŋ le ni tsiiŋ li fi-i.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Biee bi koofi yi gii naa bi ni bi kɛti mfi wu bɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Maacho 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Le Jiso ni dzɛti fɛ yih yi muntofi-i, ŋwani wu kintutu wumu tee li wuu le, “Wi wu Ntiifɛ bichɛ ɔ ŋɛŋ ta yi nyɔŋa yi nuuŋ li yih yini-i. Yih yini gbɛŋgi yɛ yi nuuŋ yih yi shaaŋ!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Jiso tuu li wuu le, “Ɔ ŋiŋgɔɔ yih yi shaaŋ yini ni? Nuuŋ tɛtɛ chimumkpaŋ tɛ̀ shɛ li chimu-u fuki fɛ bɛ bachɛ chi fɛkwiiŋ nsiŋ kɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Maacho 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Jiso dza gɛɛŋ beeŋ shee li Ŋkumɛ wu Biti bi Oli-if lɛ kimbɛ ki bichi yih yi muntofi, Pita bee Jeeŋ mɔɔ Jɔɔŋ mɔɔ Andolo gɛɛŋ bebe be tee li wuu le, <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>“Tee bee mfi wu biee bini gii naa bi ka, ɔ tuu ɔ tee tɛ̀ bee bɛndoonchɛ bɛ gii naa be doonchɛ mfi wu biee bini bichu tɛ̀ nuuŋ le bi ka.” <verse eid="MRK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Jiso se tee li bee le, “Ŋɛŋgɛ yɛɛŋ le kiiŋ wi ni tuu yɛɛŋ bɛ beŋ nɛ taŋ dze kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Bɛniiŋ ŋge gii be ni bɛɛ be dzeti bukooŋ bweŋ be tɛkisi fɛlii, wi ni kweŋgi le, ‘Ɛ mi wulu.’ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“… ɛ mi wu wulu,” tiiti nuuŋ kii Kinsofu ki Nyɔ tɛ̀ kaachɛ.</char></note> Be gii be ni be feti lɛ be yɛŋgi bɛ bɛniiŋ ŋge be se tɛndi dzé. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Ɛ nɛ naa nɛ woo le bɛ tundi baa dziŋ kɛ le dziŋ gii yi nuuŋ lu, kiiŋ shéŋ ni yi kɛɛti beŋ kɛ. Bini biɛɛ biee bi kɛmi le bi ka. Se nuuŋ le, bi doonchi yɛ le nshɛ mɛɛ yɛ kituŋ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Kwɛɛŋ gii wu ni wu tundi dziŋ bɛ wumu, mfɔŋ wumu tundi dziŋ bɛ wumu. Nshɛ gii yi ni yi nduŋgi li bintsii li bintsii li, dzeeŋ ni yi keeti. Bini biee mɛɛŋ biɛɛ fintɛŋ si ntunu wu kwɛɛŋ ti bɛɛchi.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>Fɛ nɛ nuuŋ fe, nɛ dzeti yɛɛŋ mfi. Nɛ kɛɛ le bɛ gii bɛ nyɛ beŋ li tsaŋ yi bɛniiŋ bɛ sɛki bɛnsa-a. Bɛ gii bɛ fiaamfiɛ beŋ li yíh yi kintaashɛ, nɛ gii nɛ leŋ li ŋgɔmina-a limfwe, mɔɔ li bɛmfɔ-ɔŋ limfwe kii mi, kii le nɛ tiiti baa li bee kii mi. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Se nuuŋ le bɛ kɛmi le bɛ saa bɛ tee kii ntoŋ wu dzeeŋ wu Nyɔ li tɛɛŋ chichi-i. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Mfi wu bɛ kɔɔ beŋ bɛ giiŋgi bɛ beŋ li yih yi nsa-a, kiiŋ nɛ ni nɛ buki yi laa nɛ giiŋgi baa nɛ tee le la le kɛ. Mfi wu nɛ gɛɛŋ, nɛ tiiti nɛɛ nuuŋ fiee fi buti li bimfimu binɛ-ɛ li mfi wulu-u, kifɛ mɛɛŋ yɛ n'yɔru wunɛ kɛ. Ɛ Fiana yi Waaŋ yi gii yi ni yi nyɛɛ n'yɔru li bimfimu binɛ-ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Wi gii dza dzɔɔ ŋwaani nyɛ le bɛ wo, te ŋwaŋ dzɔɔ ŋwani nyɛ le bɛ wo. Bɔɔŋ gii be dza tɛ be ni be biindi bikaa lɛ bɛtee bɛbee mɔɔ lɛ bɛni bɛbee lɛjiŋ, be ni be feti le bɛ woyɛ be. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Bɛniiŋ bɛchu gii be ni be baanini beŋ kii bukooŋ bweŋ. Se nuuŋ le, wi wu gii kaŋ shéŋ nsiiŋ gɛɛŋ bo fɛ kimɛrisɛ-ɛ gii naa bɔnɛ.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kii biee bi bɛndi yi bi gii naa bi ni bi kɛti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Maacho 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>(Wi wu teenyi kiŋwaati kini woo fini bujɔŋ,) mfi wu nɛ ŋɛŋ fiee fi bɛndi yi fi nuuŋ fi biifi kintsii fi lemi fɛ fi bee fi kɛmi yɛ le fi ni fi lemi kɛ, bɛniiŋ bɛ nuuŋ Judiya kifi be miri li bɛŋkumɛ-ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Kiiŋ wi wu nuuŋ lɛ yi-ih lɛwe tuu shee le lɛ li yih dzɔɔ mɔɔ nuuŋ fiee le ni giiŋgi bɛ fi kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Kiiŋ wi wu nuuŋ liwɛ tuu kaari le bɛ dzɔɔ ndu ye yi foochɛ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Ŋgɛ wu nyɔŋa wɛ li jo yɛɛ li bukɛɛŋ bɛ nuuŋ bɛ fe-e, mɔɔ bɛ kisi bɔɔŋ. <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Nɛ lɛki yɛɛŋ li Nyɔ-ɔ le kiiŋ fiee fini naa fi ka nuuŋ mfi wu fokpɔŋ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Bɛniiŋ gii be ŋɛŋ ŋgɛ li jo yilu-u, se ŋwaani wɛɛ ŋgɛ ti mɛɛŋɔ mɔɔ saa ki nuuŋ kɛ lu fɛ mbɛɛchɛ si Nyɔ tɛ̀ tɔŋ nshɛ mbɛ mbochu dɛɛni kɛ. Ŋwaani wɛɛ ŋgɛ mɛɛŋ yɛ le naa tuu nuuŋ mɔɔ lu kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Bee le Taa ni mɛɛŋ ki gatɛ kɛ fɛ jo yi ŋgɛ yilu kɛ, wiwoŋ mumkpaŋ wu bochɛ-ɛ lu kɛ. Se nuuŋ le, kii bɛniiŋ bee bɛ tɛ̀ tsaa kituŋ wu gɛɛ, wu gatɔɔ fɛ jo yilu-u. <verse eid="MRK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>Ɛ wi tee li be-eŋ li jo yilu-u le, ‘Bichɛ yɛɛŋ nɛ ŋɛŋ, Kinsofu ki Nyɔ tɛ̀ kaachɛ kɛɛ fɛni!’ Mɔɔ nuuŋ le, ‘Ŋɛŋ yɛɛŋ wuu wu fɛ fiiyɛ!’ Kiiŋ nɛ ni beŋ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Nɛ kɛɛ le bɛniiŋ gii naa be ni be bɛɛ be yɛŋgi le ɛ be binsofu bi Nyɔ tɛ̀ kaachɛ, bamu se ni be kweŋgi le ɛ be bɛ nuuŋ bɛntomfɔŋ bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ, be feti biee bi doonchi buŋga bubee, be feti tɛ bintɛ wa bi biee lɛ, be mɔnchi le ɛ dze nuuŋ lu, be yɛɛŋ bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ Nyɔ tɛ̀ tsaa be se taŋ dze. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Nɛ kɛɛ le. Mi nteeɔ biee bini bichu li be-eŋ bi mɛɛŋ se bi naa bi dzɔɔ kintsii.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Si fi gii fi nuuŋ mfi wu Ŋwanɛwi kaari wu bɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Maacho 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>Naa nuuŋ li jo yilu-u, mfi wu ŋgɛ wulu ka, jobɛ dza chi jiŋ, kwii tɛ tuu le wu nɛɛŋ kɛ, <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>muntsɔŋ ni mu dzɛti liboo mu weyi, biee bi liboo bichu bi kɛmi buŋga sɛɛsɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>Bɛdɛɛni, bɛniiŋ se ŋɛŋ si Ŋwanɛwi shiiti bɛɛ li kikuŋ kɛmi buŋga ŋge mɔɔ bunɔŋa. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Gii se tuumi bɛnchindaa bee be gɛɛŋ li boo yi naa li, fɛ kiboo bee nshɛ luushi, banchɛ bɛniiŋ bee bɛ tɛ̀ tsaa.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Maacho 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>Laanchɛ yɛɛŋ fiee li kigumɛ-ɛ. Ki bɛɛ fɛ ki sanyɛ yɛŋɛ, bibɛ bɛchi mbɔchɛ li ki-i, nɛ kɛɛ le ndzɛɛŋ yɛ tsɛkɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Nɛɛ lɛ ɛ nɛ ŋɛŋ biee bini kɛti, nɛ kɛɛ le mfi wulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kɛ le, “…wɛ tsɛkɛ…”</char></note> wɛ tsɛkɛtsɛkɛ fweeŋ. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Ntee beŋ chɛɛŋ le kiŋgɔkɛ ki dɛɛni kini nuuŋ ki tɛ̀ naa ma fuki fɛ biee bini bichu ka nsiŋ kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Kiboo bee nshɛ gii bi ka, se nuuŋ le, jɛ yɛŋ nuuŋ tɛ̀ naa ka kɛ.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Maacho 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>Bɛdɛɛni, wi se nuuŋ yɛ lu wu kii jobɛ chilu mɔɔ nuuŋ mfi wulu kɛ. Mɔɔ nuuŋ bɛnchindaa bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ bɛ liboo kɛ Ŋwanɛ Nyɔ kii yɛ nɛɛ tɛ kɛ. Ɛ nɛɛ Tee wuu mbiiŋ wu kii. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Bɛdɛɛni, nɛ bichi nɛ tɛŋgi, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biŋwaati bifichi bimu biɛɛ ɛ bɛ taa fɛni le, “lɛki li Nyɔ-ɔ.”</char></note> kifɛ nɛ kii yɛ mɔɔ mfi wulu kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Fi fiɛɛ si wi ti bɛɛ ɛ lɛti ndɛndɛ, fɛ dzɛti lɔɔ, gɛɛ yih ye li tsaŋ yi bɔɔŋ bee bɛ nimɛ, wi bɛ chee chi nimɛ, wi bɛ chee chi nimɛ, tee li wi wu kiichi fweeŋ wu mbaŋ le shɛ ɔ ni ɔ kiichi bujɔŋ. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Bɛdɛɛni, nɛ tɛŋgi tɛ, kifɛ nɛ kii yɛ mfi wu te yih gii naa kaari bɛ kɛ. Nuuŋ tuu bɛ lɛ fɛmfo-o, kɛ butuu kintikinti, kɛ mfi wu nyinɛshee yi ŋkosi tɔɔŋ, kɛ fɛ ŋwɛɛŋ taantaaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Kiiŋ ni dza taa mbundɛ ŋɛŋ nɛ liiti kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Fiee fi mi n'yɔ li be-eŋ fini, mi n'yɔɔ li bɛniiŋ bɛchu le, ‘Wi ni tɛŋgi.’”<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Bɛniiŋ lɛ ntsooŋ le bɛ kɔɔ Jiso bɛ wo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Maacho 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jɔɔŋ 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Tɛ̀ shɛ jo faa le ni nuuŋ jobɛ chi Tsɔnɔ chi N'yafuwee bɛ Tsɔnɔ chi Kibele ki bɛ mɛɛŋ ki gɛɛ kɛ kishee le kɛ-ɛ. Bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ tɛ̀ wɛki dze yi be nuuŋ be kɔɔ Jiso le lɛ munyiikɔɔ li, be wo. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Be lɛ ntsooŋ li yi yi bee le, “Kiiŋ tɛ ni mɔŋ fiee fini li mfi wu bɛ feti Tsɔnɔ-ɔ kɛ, kifɛ ɛ tɛ mɔŋ, fi bɛ bɛ ŋkweŋɛ lɛ bɛniiŋ li lɛnti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwɛɛŋ wumu fwa Jiso bɛ mɛɛŋ mɛ sɛɛndi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Maacho 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Jɔɔŋ 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Jiso tɛ̀ nuuŋ li kitoŋ ki Bɛtani-i, li yih yi Simu wu wi wu chigɔŋ chi nɔŋa-a, ɛ be tɛ̀ shee be jii biee, kwɛɛŋ wumu dza lɛ bɛ fikoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fikoo fini nuuŋ ɛ bɛ tɛ̀ nachɛ bɛ tɛtɛ chimu chi bɛ teenyi le, “alabasta.”</char></note> fi mɛɛŋ mamu mɛ sɛɛndi ni shuuŋŋ. Mɛɛŋ mani tɛ̀ tɛɛmi kwa ŋge, bɛ tɛ̀ nachɛ me bɛ naad wuwu. Le lɛ lɛ, bootɛ kimfimɛ ki fikoo filu tumi mɛɛŋ malu li kikoo ki Jiso-o. <figure style="fig" alt="An alabaster jar" file="hk00142c.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="14:3">Fikoo fi mɛɛŋ lɛ</figure> <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Bɛniiŋ bamu dza be ŋuŋini be be, be tiiti le, “Bifisi mɛɛŋ mani ni kii la? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Bee nuuŋ bɛ kabɛ mɛɛŋ malu, me yaa kwa bɛnchuki gii tɛɛ, bɛ nyɛ kwa wulu li bɛniiŋ bɛ kifoo lɛ.” Be ŋasɛ bɛ wu. <verse eid="MRK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Se nuuŋ le, Jiso tɛ̀ tee li bee le, “Gɛɛ yɛɛŋ wu nshiiŋ. Nɛ nyɛɛ wu ŋgɛ kii la? Wu fɛɔ nuuŋ fiee fi dzeeŋ li mi-i. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Nɛ kɛɛ le bɛniiŋ bɛ kifoo lɛ gii be ni be nuuŋ bɛ beŋ mfi kwi. Nuuŋ nɛ ni nɛ fii be mfi wu nɛ kɔŋgisi. Se nuuŋ le, nnuuŋ ntɛ nuuŋ bɛ beŋ mfi kwi kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Kwɛɛŋ wuni fɛɔ nuuŋ fiee fi bee kɛmi le fɛ. Wu fwaɔ mi bɛ mɛɛŋ mani ni, le nachɛ nuuŋ yi yɛŋ mɛɛŋ si bɛ gii bɛ diyɛ mi. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Ntee beŋ chɛɛŋ le, mɔɔ nuuŋ fɛŋ fɛ bɛ gii bɛ ni bɛ fenjisi ntoŋ wu dzeeŋ wuni li kikoo ki nshɛ kichu, fiee fi kwɛɛŋ wuni fɛ bɛ gii bɛ ni bɛ tiiti tɛ kii fi, bɛ kiimi wu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judas gɛɛŋ le kabɛ Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Maacho 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Judas Iskaliyɔ wu tɛ̀ nuuŋ wi kintutu ki bɔɔŋ bɛ kintutu-u bɛ Jiso bɛ yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ wɛ tɛ̀ dza gɛɛŋ fɛ bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa le kabɛ Jiso li bee. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Le be woo lɛ, be nɛɛtɛ ŋge, be kaachɛ wu le be gii be nyɛ wu kwa. Se bɛchi wɛki dze yi gii nyɛ Jiso li tsaŋ yi bee.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee ji biee bi lɛ kimɛrisɛ-ɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Maacho 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jɔɔŋ 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Jobɛ chi ŋkosi chi Tsɔnɔ chi Kibele ki bɛ mɛɛŋ ki gɛɛ kɛ kishee le kɛ chi be tɛ̀ shiiŋ be sɛɛti ŋwaŋ wu kiŋkɔ li Tsɔnɔ chi N'yafuwee tɛ̀ bɛ chi kɔchɛ, bɔɔŋ bɛ Jiso-o bɛ kintutu-u bii li wuu laa, “Ɔ wɛki le tɛ gɛɛŋ tɛ nachɛ nuuŋ fɛŋ le ke ɔ ji Tsɔnɔ chi N'yafuwee fe?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Se toŋ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu bamu bɛfɛ, tee li bee le, “Gɛnɛ yɛɛŋ li kito-oŋ, mfi wu nɛ giiŋgi lɔɔ, nɛ gii nɛ ŋɛŋ wi wumu ɛ wu too dzɔɔ lɛ tɛnɛ-ɛ, nɛ biee wu. <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>Mfi wu wu gɛɛŋ wu lɛ li yih yi wu lɛ lu-u, nɛ tee li wi wu kɛmi yih yilu-u le Wi wu Ntiifɛ biitɔɔ laa loŋ we wu bɛniiŋ bɛ ndɛndɛ-ɛ wu bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u gii be ji Tsɔnɔ chi N'yafuwee lu nuuŋ fɛŋ le? <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Gii se doonchɛ loŋ wu nyɔŋa wu lɛwe li yih yi biji-i wu bɛ bɔsɛyi bɛ nachɛ kituŋ wu nuuŋ, nɛ se nachɛ biee bijɛ lu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Bɔɔŋ bɛ kintutu bɛlu se dza be gɛɛŋ li kitoŋ kilu-u, be gɛɛŋ be ŋɛŋ biee nɛɛ yɛɛŋ si Jiso bee tee li bee. Be se nachɛ biee bijɛ bi Tsɔnɔ chi N'yafuwee chilu-u lu. <verse eid="MRK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Le ni nuuŋ lɛ fɛmfo-o, Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu bɛ yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ baa taashɛ lu. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Be shee be jii biee, Jiso dza tee li bee le, “Ntee beŋ chɛɛŋ le wi wumu li beŋ linti gii kabɛ mi, wi wuni jiiɔ biee tɛɛ wu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Le be woo lɛ, be dza be to nshiiŋ nshiiŋ, be se tiiti li wuu wi mumkpaŋ mumkpaŋ le, “Ŋkiiɔ le ɛ mi kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Se tuu le, “Ɛ nɛɛ wi wumu li beŋ bɛ yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ bani-i wu fuundi kibele lɛ sho-o tɛɛ wu. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Ŋwanɛwi gii gɛɛŋ nɛɛ si bɛ tɛ̀ tsɛɛ kii wu. Se nuuŋ le, ŋgɛ wu nyɔŋa wɛ li wi wu kabɛ Ŋwanɛwi. Fi tɛ̀ dzɔɔŋ ŋge le gii bɛ ba wu ki biɛ kɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee ji ntɛh wu Nyɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Maacho 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Si be tɛ̀ jii biee lɛ, Jiso dza dzɔ kibele, nyɛ kiyɔɔni li Nyɔ-ɔ, booyɛ, nyɛ li bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u tee le, “Kɔ yɛɛŋ, yiiŋ yi yɛŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Tuu dzɔ tɛ fika, nyɛ kiyɔɔni li Nyɔ-ɔ, se nyɛ fika filu li bee, be woŋ be bɛchu. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Tee li bee le, “Mani nuuŋ ŋgɔŋ meŋ mɛ Nyɔ ji leh lu me bo kii bɛniiŋ ŋge. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Ntee beŋ chɛɛŋ le mɛɛŋ yɛ naa ntuu ŋ'woŋ mbiiŋ mɛ gwɛɛŋ wu kiti ki lɛɛndi mani-i kɛ nsiiŋ gɛɛŋ bo jobɛ chi ŋgii naa ŋ'woŋ mɛfɛŋ bɛ beŋ lɛnti lɛ bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Le Jiso bee bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u mɛɛshi, be yoo jumi chi n'yɔɔnchɛ-ɛ, be dza be michi be giiŋgi li Ŋkumɛ wu Biti bi Oli-if.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso tee le Pita gii faaŋ wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Maacho 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jɔɔŋ 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Jiso tɛ̀ dza tee li bee le, “Beŋ bɛchu gii nɛ tuu bikaa lijiŋ. Fi nuuŋ si bɛ tɛ̀ tsɛɛ Nyɔ tiiti le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Ŋgii ŋ'wo wi wu kiichi nshɔ́ɔŋ, nshɔ́ɔŋ se saaŋgɛ.’<verse eid="MRK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Se nuuŋ le, mfi wu Nyɔ buu mi li kwe-e, ntoo mbaŋ li be-eŋ Galilii.” <verse eid="MRK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Pita tuu li Jiso le, “Mɔɔ nuuŋ le bɛniiŋ bɛchu gii be chee bikaa lɛ wɛɛ jiŋ, be to lijiŋ, nuuŋ ntɛ nchee kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Jiso tee li wuu le, “Ntee wɛ chɛɛŋ le butuu bu bɛŋ buni, fi fiɛɛ le fɛ nyinɛshee gii yi ni yi nuuŋ le yi tɔɔŋ kiŋga kifɛ, nuuŋ ɔɔ faaŋ mi kiŋga kitɛɛtɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Pita yɔ bɛ buŋga tee le, “Mɔɔ nuuŋ le ŋkwi tɛɛ wɛ, nuuŋ ntɛ naa mfaaŋ wɛ kɛ.” Le tee lɛ, be bɛchu tee nɛɛ tɛ si wu tee lɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso lɛkɛ li Nyɔ Gɛsɛmani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Maacho 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Be gɛɛŋ be lɛ li wɛ wu mbaŋ wumu-u, bɛ teenyi le Gɛsɛmani, Jiso tee li bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu le, “Shee yɛɛŋ fɛni, ŋgɛɛŋ nlɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Dzɔ Pita bɛ Jeeŋ mɔɔ Jɔɔŋ, bee be dza fe. Se dza tuu seki biee wuki ntɔnyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Tee li bee le, “Shéŋ yɛŋ yɛɛ nshiiŋ nshiiŋ ŋge yi nuuŋ ŋkwi. Shɛ yɛɛŋ nɛ ni nɛ tɛŋgi fɛni.” <verse eid="MRK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Jiso dza fe kiiŋgi gɛɛŋ limfwe niiŋ, we fɛkwiiŋ, lɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ le ɛ dze bee yi nuuŋ lu, mfi wu ŋgɛ wulu ka nɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Lɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ le, “Abba,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abaa nuuŋ lɛ jɛ́ yi Aramaik</char></note> Baa wɛŋ, ɔ nuuŋ ɔ fɛ nɛɛ fiee fichu. Tsaaki fika fi ŋgɛ fini kii ni ŋ'woŋ. Se nuuŋ le, fɛrɛ nɛɛ si ɔ kɔŋgisi. Kiiŋ ɔ ni fɛ si ŋkɔŋgisi kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Jiso kaari to lijiŋ lɛ bee, ŋɛŋ be liiti. Bii li Pita laa, “Simu, ɔ liiti lɔɔ ni? Ɔ nuuŋ tɛ taaŋ le gɛɛŋ bo ntaŋ wu mfi mumkpaŋ ni? <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Nɛ nuuŋ yɛɛŋ we nɛ lɛki li Nyɔ-ɔ kii mɔnchɛ ni bɛ lɛ be-eŋ. Fi fiɛɛ chɛɛŋ le shéŋ kɔŋgisi yɛɛ, se nuuŋ le nyaŋ yi bwiŋ nuuŋ fɛɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Si wu tee lɛ kaari gɛɛŋ lɛkɛ li Nyɔ-ɔ nɛɛ si bee saa lɛki li Nyɔ-ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Le tuu ni karisi tuu lijiŋ, ŋɛŋ bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u be liiti kifɛ chilefɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ be lɛ lii ŋge. Be mɛɛŋ ki kɛɛ kɛ fiee fi be nuuŋ be tuu li wuu kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Kaari to lijiŋ kiŋga kitɛɛtɛ, bii li bee laa, “Nɛ mɛɛŋ nɛ liiti nɛ fufini finɛ ni? Chi kɔchɛ chɛɛ. Mfi wulu bɛɛɔ. Bɛ kabɛ baa Ŋwanɛwi li bɛniiŋ bɛ bifi-i. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Dza yɛɛŋ we tɛɛbeŋ tɛ ni tɛ giiŋgi. Bichɛ yɛɛŋ nɛ ŋɛŋ, wi wu kabɛ mi bɛɛɔ kituŋ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛ kɔɔ Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Maacho 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Jɔɔŋ 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Nɛɛ si Jiso tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ yeti lɛ, mfwaa mumkpaŋ Judas wu tɛ̀ nuuŋ wi kintutu ki bɔɔŋ bɛ Jiso bɛ yoofi ntsɔ bɛfɛ baa biee busɛ. Tɛ̀ gii bɛɛ bɛ kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ be kɛmi nyɔ́ bɛ bimboki, ɛ bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bɛ sɛki kwɛɛŋ tɛ̀ toŋ be. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Tɛ̀ nuuŋ ɛ wi wu tɛ̀ kabɛ Jiso wulu tɛ̀ nachɛ bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛlu tee le, “Wi wu ŋgii n'yɛsi, ŋkokɛ nyɔɔchɛ, ɛ wu, nɛ biee nɛ kɔɔ wu, nɛ dzɔ wu, nɛ giiŋgi bɛ wu nɛ bichi kii ni letɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Si Judas bɛ lɛ, gɛɛŋ mfwaa mumkpaŋ fɛ Jiso, yɛsi wu le, “Wi wu Ntiifɛ.” Si wu yɛsi wu lɛ, kokɛ wu nyɔɔchɛ wu. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Bɛniiŋ baa lɔŋ tsaŋ li Jiso, be cha wu. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Wi wumu tɛ̀ gii lemi bee bɛ Jiso tsɔɔ nyɔ ye yi dziŋ, kɛri kintooŋ ki mfwa wu kikoo ki bɛte muntofi lu, sondɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Jiso bii li bɛniiŋ bɛlu laa, “Nɛ bɛ le nɛ kɔɔ mi nɛ bɛɛ bɛ nyɔ́ mɔɔ bimboki kɛɛ nɛ bɛ le nɛ kɔɔ nuuŋ wi ni? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Ntuu nshiiŋ nuuŋ tɛɛbeŋ li jo-o li jo-o mɔɔ li yíh yi muntofi, ntiifi bɛniiŋ, nɛ mɛɛŋ ki kɔɔ kɛ mi kɛ. Se nuuŋ le, fini kɛti fiɛɛ dɛɛni ni le fiee fi bɛ tɛ̀ tsɛɛ lɛ Kiŋwaati ki Nyɔ-ɔ bɛ fi kɔchɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Bɔɔŋ bɛ Jiso bɛ kintutu bɛchu se lɔŋ wu fe, be kifi. <verse eid="MRK 14:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Sɔɔnɛ wi wumu tɛ̀ biki wu, ti mɛɛŋ ki lii kɛ fiee ndu li wuu bwiŋ kɛ, tɛ̀ nuuŋ nɛɛ bɛ ŋkweŋkwe wu ndu kwaa libwiŋ. Be gɛɛŋ le be kɔɔ tɛ̀ wu, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>ndu yilu fanchɛ, chinɛ letɛ tiŋ kilɛrɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛ saa nsa wu Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Maacho 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Jɔɔŋ 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Be dzɔ Jiso, be gɛɛŋ bɛ wu fɛ kikoo ki bɛte muntofi-i. Bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ sɛki kwɛɛŋ mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi baanchɛ fe. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Be tɛ̀ giiŋgi bɛ Jiso Pita biki lɛjiŋ mfiiŋ. Gɛɛŋ bo la kintikinti wu kikoo ki bɛte muntofi-i, se shee bee bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ kiichi la wulu wɔɔnsi wi. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛchu bɛ sɛki bɛnsa tɛ wɛki fiee fi be nuuŋ be kayɛ li Jiso-o, fi fɛ se be wo wu. Se nuuŋ le, be ti mɛɛŋ ki ŋɛŋ kɛ fiee kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Bɛniiŋ ŋge tɛ̀ lemi lɛjiŋ lɛ nsa wu binsɛɛ li kii Jiso. Se nuuŋ le, wi tɛ̀ tiiti yɛ fiee fi kɔchini bɛ fi wumu kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Bɛniiŋ bamu tɛ̀ dza be leŋ we, be kayɛ bi bee binsɛɛ li wuu, be tee le, <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>“Tɛ̀ tuu tɛ̀ woo tiiti le gii shaanshɛ yih yi muntofi yini yi wiwoŋ gwaŋ bɛ tsaŋ, dzɔɔ jo taa kaari gwaŋ yimi yi nuuŋ yɛ ŋgwanu wu wiwoŋ kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Mɔɔ si be tɛ̀ tiiti lɛ, tefɛ chi bee tɛ̀ bɛɛ yɛ chi kɔchini kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Kikoo ki bɛte muntofi-i se dza ki leŋ we bɛniiŋ limfwe, ki bii li Jiso-o laa, “Ɔ kɛmi yɛ fiee fi ɔ nuuŋ ɔ tuu kɛ ni? Ɔ wuki nɛɛ biee bi bɛniiŋ bani tiiti kii wɛ ni?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Jiso ba shiiŋ, mɛɛŋ ki tuu kɛ fiee kɛ. Kikoo ki bɛte muntofi kɛɛ tuu ki bii li Jiso-o laa, “Ɔ nuuŋ Kinsofu ki Nyɔ tɛ̀ kaachɛ ki Ŋwanɛ Nyɔ, Nyɔ yi bɛ yɔɔnchi ni?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Jiso tuu le, “Ɛ mi. Nɛ gii naa nɛ ŋɛŋ si Ŋwanɛwi shee lɛ kibɛnɛ ki kigɔŋɛ ki Nyɔ-ɔ yi kɛmi Buŋga-a, nɛ tuu nɛ ŋɛŋ si shiiti bɛɛ liboo li kiku-uŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Kikoo ki bɛte muntofi kɛɛ woo lɛ, ki gaamɛ ndú yi ki, ki bii laa, “Fiee mɛɛŋ lu fi tɛɛbeŋ tuu geendi wi le leŋ fɛni ni tiiti ni?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:63 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɛ̀ gaamɛ ndú yee lɛ, kifɛ fi tɛ̀ tɔnyɛ wu.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Nɛ mɛɛŋ ki woo kɛ si dzeti kintsii ki Nyɔ-ɔ ni? Nɛ tee le la?” Bɛniiŋ bɛchu sondɛ le wɛ wi wu bɛ nuuŋ bɛ wo buwo. <verse eid="MRK 14:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Bɛniiŋ bamu bɛchi be kwiyi Jiso bɛ budii, be kaŋ lii yee, be juti wu bɛ muŋkɔ, be tiiti le, “Doonchɛ kintomfɔŋ ki Nyɔ-ɔ kɛɛ dɛɛni.” Bɛniiŋ bɛ nchi dza be dzɔ Jiso be bɛchi be tuki wu.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pita faaŋ Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Maacho 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Jɔɔŋ 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Si Pita tɛ̀ nuuŋ dze lɛ kwiiŋ la kintikinti lɛ, ŋwaakwɛɛŋ wumu li bɔɔŋ bɛ bukɛɛŋ bɛ tɛ̀ nindi li kikoo ki bɛte muntofi-i dza bɛ li wuu lichiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Si wu ŋɛŋ Pita wɔɔnsi wi lɛ, bichɛ wu ni fwiiŋ, tee le, “Ɔ bee tɛ nɛɛ Jiso Wi wu Nasarɛ wɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Pita faaŋ, tee le, “Ŋkii yɛ fiee fi ɔ tiiti fini kɛ. Ŋkii yɛ kɛ.” Si wu tee lɛ, dza fe gɛɛŋ fɛ fweeŋ wu mbaŋ, nyinɛshee tɔɔŋ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se nuuŋ le biŋwaati bi fichi bimu kɛmiyɛ n'yɔru wu le, “nyinɛshee tɔɔŋ,” kɛ.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Le ŋwaakwɛɛŋ wɛ ka ŋɛŋ wu, tee li bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ lemi fe-e le, “Wi wuni ɛ wi wumu li bee linti.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Pita ka faaŋ. Le mfi kiiŋgi niiŋ, bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ lemi fe baa tuu be tee li Pita-a le, “Ɛ chɛɛŋ le ɔ nuuŋ wi wu be, kifɛ ɛ wɛ wi wu Galilii.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Pita chini, teeŋ kinlɔɔ li yi yee li, tee le, “Ŋkii yɛ wi wu nɛ tiiti kii wu wuni kɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Mfwaa mumkpaŋ nyinɛshee tuu yi tɔɔŋ li kiŋga kifɛ. Pita se kimi tefɛ chi Jiso bee tee li wuu le, “Nyinɛshee gii ni yi nuuŋ le yi tɔɔŋ kiŋga kifɛ, nuuŋ ɔɔ faaŋ mi kiŋga kitɛɛtɛ.” Waŋ kwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Bɛ nyɛ Jiso li tsaŋ yi Pailɛt wi wu sɛki Lom kimbɛ ki Judiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Maacho 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jɔɔŋ 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Le lɛkuuŋ ni le nuuŋ kɛɛ le wuuti laa ni, bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ sɛki kwɛɛŋ mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ, mɔɔ bɛniiŋ bɛchu bɛ sɛki bɛnsa, bɛ be shee be dzɔ ntaŋ, be kaŋ Jiso, be dzɔ wu be gɛɛŋ bɛ wu be nyɛ li tsaŋ yi Pailɛ-ɛt. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Pailɛt bii li Jiso laa, “Ɛ wɛ Mfɔŋ wu Bɛjuu ni?” Jiso tuu li wuu le, “Fi fiɛɛ si ɔ tee.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa se bɛchi be kayi biee li Jiso-o ŋge. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Nɛɛ lɛ, Pailɛt tuu bii li Jiso laa, “Ɔ kɛmi yɛ fiee fi ɔ nuuŋ ɔ tuu kɛ ni? Ɔ wukɔɔ nɛɛ biee bi bɛ kayi li wɛ-ɛ bini ni?” <verse eid="MRK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Se nuuŋ le, Jiso ti mɛɛŋ ki tuu kɛ le tuu fiee li wuu kɛ. Fiee filu yaa Pailɛt.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Maacho 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jɔɔŋ 18:39–19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Bɛdɛɛni tɛ̀ nuuŋ li mfi wu Tsɔnɔ chi N'yafuwee chini, Pailɛt buu wi wu ncha mumkpaŋ li yih yi ncha-a wu bɛniiŋ lɛkɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Tɛ̀ nuuŋ li mfi wulu-u, wi wumu nuuŋ li yih yi ncha-a bukooŋ le Baraba, nuuŋ li kintutu ki bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ li yih yi ncha-a bɛ tɛ̀ bɛchi kpɛ fɛ kintsii li be woyɛ bɛniiŋ baa. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ se bɛchi ki tiiti le Pailɛt fɛ si ti shiiŋ feti li bee. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Pailɛt bii li bee laa, “Nɛ wɛki le mbuu nuuŋ Mfɔŋ wu Bɛjuu ni?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Tɛ̀ gii biiti lɛ kifɛ tɛ̀ kii le bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa tɛ̀ nyɛ Jiso li tsaŋ yee li kifɛ bimi tɛ̀ fuumi be bɛ wu. <verse eid="MRK 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Se nuuŋ le, bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa tɛ̀ kunsɛ kintutu ki bɛniiŋ lɛ le be tee le buu nuuŋ Baraba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Pailɛt tuu bii li bee laa, “Ɛ mi mbuu lɛ, ŋgeeŋ bɛ wi wuni wu nɛ teenyi le Mfɔŋ wu Bɛjuu wuni?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Be tuu be waŋ lɛwe le, “Bɛ ta wu li kintaaŋ li bu taru.” <verse eid="MRK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Pailɛt bii li bee laa, “Bɛ ta wu kii la? Fiee fi bifi fi wu fɛ nuuŋ la?” Be tuu be wɛndi be giiŋgi nɛɛ bulimfwee le, “Bɛ taaŋ wu li kintaaŋ li.” <verse eid="MRK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Nɛɛ lɛ, Pailɛt se buu nuuŋ Baraba kifɛ tɛ̀ wɛki le fɛ si kintutu kɛɛ tɛ̀ kɔŋgisi. Tee bɛ fiaaŋ Jiso, se nyɛ le be gɛɛŋ be taaŋ wu li kintaaŋ li.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛniiŋ bɛ nchi-i bɛ Pailɛ-ɛt choosɛ Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Maacho 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Jɔɔŋ 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Bɛniiŋ bɛ nchi bɛ Pailɛ-ɛt se dzɔ Jiso be lɛ be gɛɛŋ bɛ wu lɛ ntɔ wu bɛ tɛ̀ teenyi le Pletoolom. Si be tɛ̀ lɛ lɛ, be se koŋ kiŋkɛ ki kintutu ki bɛniiŋ bɛ nchi-i kɛɛ kichu ki banchɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Be dzɔ ndu yi bumfɔŋ yi gbɔɔ be chuumɛ wu li bwiŋ, be se lo kifɔ ki bumfɔ-ɔŋ ki nuuŋ biaŋ biaŋ be beeŋ wu li fa. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Be bɛchi be bundi wu le, “Buri, Mfɔŋ wu Bɛjuu.” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Si be tɛ̀ feti lɛ be tuki wu bɛ kimbaaŋ li kikoo li, be kwiyi wu bɛ budii, be bɛɛ be tundi núŋ wu lii, be bundi wu. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Le be choosɛ wu lɛ be mɛɛshi, be kaari be buu ndu yi bumfɔŋ yi gbɔɔ yɛ wu li bwiŋ, be lii wu ndú yee li bwiŋ, be dzɔ wu be giiŋgi le be gɛɛŋ be taaŋ wu li kintaaŋ li.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛ taaŋ Jiso li kintaaŋ li</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Maacho 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jɔɔŋ 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Le be ni be giiŋgi, be bikɛ bɛ wi wumu kuuki litɔɔ bukooŋ bwee le Simu, nuuŋ wi wu Sɛliŋ. Tɛ̀ nuuŋ te Alɛkɛsanda bɛ Lufu. Be kaŋ wu le too kintaaŋ ki Jiso-o. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Be giiŋgi bɛ Jiso, be gɛɛŋ be bo fɛ kintsii ki bɛ teenyi le Gɔɔgɔɔta, (bukooŋ buni nuuŋ le Kiŋgefi ki Kikoo lɛ,) <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>be nyɛ mbiiŋ li wuu le woŋ ɛ be fiinsɛ bɛ ntsi yimi yi bɛ teenyi le mɛɛ. Se nuuŋ le Jiso ti mɛɛŋ ki woŋ kɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbiiŋ mani tɛ nuuŋ le me fɛ le wu woo kɛ ntɔnyɛ kɛ.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Be se ta wu li kintaaŋ li. Be dzɔ ndú yee le be gachɛ li yi yi bee be se toŋ kaŋ bɛ ndú yilu le be kɛɛ wi wu nuuŋ dzɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Mfi wu be tɛ ta Jiso li kintaaŋ li tɛ̀ nuuŋ jobɛ bikaa mfomɛyoofi fɛŋwɛɛŋ. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Bɛ tsɛɛ fiee fi bɛ ta wu li kintaaŋ li kii fi, fi nuuŋ le, “Mfɔŋ wu Bɛjuu.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Bɛ tɛ̀ tayɛ tɛ bɛyi bamu bɛfɛ li bintaaŋ li wumu lɛ kibɛnɛ ki Jiso-o ki kigɔŋɛ, wumu lɛ kibɛnɛ kee ki kimɛsɛ. [<verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Fi se bɛ fi kɔchɛ si bɛ tɛ̀ tsɛɛ lɛ Kiŋwaati ki Nyɔ-ɔ le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 15:28">“Bɛ tɛ̀ fa wu li kintutu ki bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ chɔ biee li lɛnti.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biŋwaati bi fichi bimu kɛmiyɛ kiŋkɛ ki 28 kini kɛ.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Bɛniiŋ se kɛti be ŋiŋgi Jiso be tiki bikoo, be tsuki wu bɛ ntsooŋ be tiiti le, “Ɛŋhɛɛŋ! Wɛ wu nuuŋ ɔ shaanshɛ yih yi muntofi ɔ kaari ɔ gwaŋ yi li jo taa li, <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>fi yi ya, ɔ shee li kintaaŋ kɛɛ li.” <verse eid="MRK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Bɛte muntofi bɛ nɔŋa bɛ nɔŋa bɛ bɛniiŋ bɛ tiifi bɛnchi bɛ Nyɔ-ɔ tuu bee choosi wu be tiiti li yi yi bee le, “Tɛ̀ gii fii bɛniiŋ bamu, kɛɛ nuuŋ fi yi yee nsiŋ. <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Wu wu nuuŋ Kinsofu ki Nyɔ tɛ̀ kaachɛ, wu wu nuuŋ Mfɔŋ wu bɛniiŋ bɛ Isɛlɛɛ shee li kintaaŋ li dɛɛni tɛ ŋɛŋ tɛ se beŋ li wuu.” Bɛniiŋ bɛ bɛ tɛ̀ taaŋ be li bintaaŋ li bɛ Jiso baa tɛ̀ tsuki tɛ wu bɛ ntsooŋ.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso kwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Maacho 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jɔɔŋ 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Le gɛɛŋ bo fɛnshaaŋ kintikinti, lɛkuuŋ dza le jiŋ kwɛɛŋ kwikwi nsiiŋ gɛɛŋ bo jobɛ bikaa bitɛɛtu lɛ fɛmfo-o. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Le ni nuuŋ jobɛ bikaa bitɛɛtu, Jiso dza dzaaŋ lɛwe le, “Ɛlɔy, Ɛlɔy lama sabatani,” fi nuuŋ le, “Nyɔ yɛŋ, Nyɔ yɛŋ, ɛ la fi ɔ lɔŋ mi ni?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Le bɛniiŋ bamu bɛ tɛ̀ lemi fe woo, be tee le, “Yikɛ yɛɛŋ nɛ woo, teenyɔɔ Ɛlaja.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Wi wumu li bee linti dza letɛ dzɔ kifiiŋ, fooŋ li mbiiŋ mɛ mgbanyi-i, fasɛ li fintiiŋ li nɛɛki le woŋ, se tee le, “Lemɛ yɛɛŋ tɛ ŋɛŋ laa Ɛlaja gii bɛ shiiki wu li kintaaŋ kini-i le.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Jiso dza waŋ kwe lɛwe ŋge se yindɛ yindinɛ wu kimɛrisɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Ndu yi tɛ̀ gatini yih yi muntofi lɛnti tɛ̀ batɛ kintikinti mbɛɛchɛ fɛwe mbɔwu mbochu fɛtɛ li biŋkɛ bifɛ-ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Le te kikoo wu bɛniiŋ bɛ nchi-i wu tɛ̀ lemi Jiso limfwe tuu ŋɛŋ dze yi Jiso kwi le, se tee le, “Chɛɛŋ chɛɛŋ, wi wuni tuu nuuŋ Ŋwanɛ Nyɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Bukɛɛŋ bamu tɛ̀ lemi fe mfiiŋ be bichi. Li bee linti tɛ̀ nuuŋ Maariya Madaliŋ bɛ Maariya wu ni Jeeŋ wu bwi bɛ Jɔsɛ, wumu nuuŋ Salomɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Bukɛɛŋ bani nuuŋ bɛ tɛ̀ shiiŋ be biki Jiso Galilii be fii wu. Be tɛ̀ nuuŋ fe mɔɔ bukɛɛŋ bamu tɛ ŋge bɛ tɛ̀ biee Jiso bee be bɛ Jɛrosalɛŋ.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛ diyɛ Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Maacho 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jɔɔŋ 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Tɛ̀ nuuŋ lɛ fɛmfo-o booyaa, ɛ tɛ̀ nuuŋ Jobɛ chi nachɛ-ɛ le be lɛ li jobɛ chi bɛshiinshi-i, <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>wi wumu wu Arimatia wu bɛ tɛ̀ teenyi le Jɔsɛ, kaŋ shéŋ gɛɛŋ ŋɛŋ Pailɛt lɛkɛ gwini chi Jiso-o le gɛɛŋ diyɛ. Jɔsɛ wuni tɛ̀ nuuŋ wi wu kintutu ki bɛniiŋ bɛ sɛki kwɛɛŋ lɛ, ɛ bɛniiŋ tɛ̀ guundi wu ŋge. Ɛ wu kibɛɛ tɛ̀ gii tɛŋgi tɛ mfi wu bumfɔŋ bu Nyɔ-ɔ gii naa bu bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Pailɛt woo, kimfimɛ wondɛ wu le Jiso kwiɔ kituŋ. Se teeŋ te kikoo wu bɛniiŋ bɛ nchi-i wɛ bɛ, se bii li wuu laa Jiso bee kwi kituŋ ni. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Le woo li te kikoo wu bɛniiŋ bɛ nchi-i wɛ le Jiso bee kwi, se nyɛ gwini chilu li Jɔsɛ-ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Jɔsɛ se dza gɛɛŋ go ndu yi dzeeŋ, gɛɛŋ shiiki gwini chi Jiso-o, fiɛɛmɛ fe, gɛɛŋ giiki lɛ dziŋ yi bɛ tɛ̀ chɔ li kimba-aŋ, biiŋgi tɛtɛ chi nɔŋa baanyɛ fweeŋ wu dziŋ yilu lu. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Maariya Madaliŋ bɛ Maariya wu ni Jɔsɛ tɛ̀ ŋɛŋ kintsii ki bɛ diyɛ Jiso fe.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Jiso bo li kwe-e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Maacho 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jɔɔŋ 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Le jobɛ chi bɛshiinshi bɛ chi ka, Maariya Madaliŋ bɛ Maariya wu ni Jeeŋ, mɔɔ Salomɛ go mɛɛŋ mɛ sɛɛndi le be gɛɛŋ be fwa gwini chi Jiso-o lu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Ɛ tɛ̀ gii mɛɛŋ taantaaŋ nɛɛ si jobɛ mɛɛŋ chi tɛti li jobɛ chi ŋkosi li fuu li, be dza be giiŋgi fɛ dziŋ fɛ-ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Si be tɛ̀ giiŋgi lɛ be tɛ̀ tiiti li yi yi bee le, ɛ noo wu gii bachɛ tɛtɛ chi bɛ bɛŋɛ mfweeŋ wu dziŋ wɛɛ be se lɛ le? <verse eid="MRK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Se nuuŋ le, le be lendi lii, be ŋɛŋ ɛ bɛ tɛ̀ biiŋgi tɛtɛ chilu. Tɛtɛ chini tɛ̀ nuuŋ kiŋgiŋgiri ki tɛtɛ-ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Le be lɛ lɛ dziŋ, be ŋɛŋ sɔɔnɛ wi wumu ɛ wu shee lɛ kibɛnɛ ki kigɔŋɛ-ɛ ɛ wu chuumɛ ndú yi njeeŋ, yi nɛŋgi. Yi kofi be. <figure style="fig" alt="They saw a young man in the tomb" file="cn01851c.tif" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="16:5">Be ŋɛŋ sɔɔnɛ wi lɛ dziŋ</figure> <verse eid="MRK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Sɔɔnɛ wi wulu tee li bee le, “Kiiŋ yi ni yi koofi beŋ kɛ. Ŋkiiɔ le nɛ wɛki baa nuuŋ Jiso wu Nasarɛ wu bɛ tuu bɛ taaŋ li kintaaŋ li wɛ. Mɛɛŋ yɛ fɛni kɛ. Wu boɔ li kwe-e. Bichɛ yɛɛŋ nɛ ŋɛŋ fɛ bɛ tuu bɛ giiki wu. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Gɛnɛ yɛɛŋ nɛ tee li bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u mɔɔ li Pita-a le tuutɔɔ mbaaŋ li bee Galilii. Nɛ gii nɛ ŋɛŋ wu le si tɛ̀ tee beŋ.” <verse eid="MRK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Bukɛɛŋ baa bo lɛ dziŋ be kɛɛti ni kikikiki, be dza be kifi, ɛ bimfimu gbɛɛŋ bi wondɛ be ni kataraa. Be ti mɛɛŋ ki tee kɛ fiee li wi-i kɛ, kifɛ be tɛ̀ chɛndi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biŋwaati bi fichi bimu kɛmiyɛ biŋga bi 16:9-20 kɛ.</char></note></para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 16:8">Jiso doonchɛ yi yee li bɛniiŋ li</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Maacho 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Jɔɔŋ 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Jiso tɛ̀ bo li kwe-e li jobɛ chi ŋkosi chi li fuu li mɛɛŋ li ki bitebite-e, saa busɛ nuuŋ lɛ Maariya Madaliŋ lii wu tɛ̀ buu bɔɔŋ bɛ kiŋkundi-i li yi yee li mfomɛnyaaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Maariya se gɛɛŋ tee li bɛniiŋ bɛ Jiso tɛ̀ nuuŋ bee be. Bɛniiŋ bani tɛ̀ nuuŋ ɛ be shee be chiŋ bikoo be dii. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Le be woo si kwɛɛŋ wɛ tiiti le bee ŋɛŋ Jiso nuuŋ lu, be ti mɛɛŋ ki beŋ kɛ dududu.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Lɛjiŋ lɛlu, Jiso tuu doonchɛ yi yee li bɛniiŋ bee bamu bɛ kintutu-u bɛfɛ be giiŋgi li kitoŋ kimu ɛ mbosɛ yee fiiki. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Be to lijiŋ, be gɛɛŋ be tee li kiŋkɛ ki bɛniiŋ bɛ kintutu-u, be ti mɛɛŋ ki beŋ li bee kɛ.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Maacho 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jɔɔŋ 20:19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Lɛjiŋ lɛlu Jiso doonchɛ yi yee dɛɛni li bɔɔŋ bee bɛ yoofi ntsɔ mumkpa-aŋ kibɛɛ fɛ be tɛ̀ jii biee. Se wamɛ be, kifɛ be tɛ̀ mɛɛŋ ki beŋ kɛ, be tɛ̀ tɛɛmi bikoo le be beŋ li bɛniiŋ bɛ tɛ̀ ŋɛŋ wu mfi wu tɛ̀ bo li kwe-e. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Se tee li bee le, “Gɛnɛ yɛɛŋ li kwɛɛŋ kwikwi-i nɛ gɛɛŋ nɛ ni nɛ fenjisi ntoŋ wu dzeeŋ wu Nyɔ li bɛniiŋ bɛchu-u. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Wi wu beŋ li ntoŋ wulu-u, bɛ lii wu li dzɔɔ, gii bɔnɛ. Wi wu faaŋ mbeenchɛ, gii we nsa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Bɛniiŋ bɛ gii be beŋ gii be ni be feti biee bi doonchi buŋga bu Nyɔ-ɔ si buni: be gii be ni be busi bɔɔŋ bɛ kiŋkundi-i li bɛniiŋ li, li bukooŋ bwe-eŋ. Be gii be yɔ jɛ́ yi fiɛŋ. <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>Be gii be ni be kɛmi li yɔ́-ɔ bɛ tsaŋ. Mɔɔ be woŋ tsi, yi tɛ ge be fiee kɛ. Be gii be ni be giki tsaŋ li bɛniiŋ bɛ gendi-i, be tɛɛmi.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiso yɛɛ liboo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24:50-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Le Taa Jiso yɔ li bee lɛ mɛɛshi, Nyɔ se dzɔ wu yɛɛ liboo shee lɛ kibɛnɛ ki kigɔŋɛ ki Nyɔ-ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Bɔɔŋ bee bɛ kintutu-u dza be deŋgi be tiifi toŋ wu dzeeŋ li bitsii bichu-u. Taa se nindi bee be fɛɛfi fiee fi be tɛ̀ tiifi le fi fiɛɛ chɛɛŋ bɛ biee bi doonchi buŋga bu Nyɔ-ɔ bi be tɛ̀ feti.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
